{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ESMZPvThJbCpYoRszRfEAT","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Universality claim scoped 为 ''K*=2 is consistent across all tested\n2\t  conditions meeting minimum information requirements (≥256 tokens; standard decoding)''。Mistral\n3\t  的失败被分析为 architecture-specific information compression rate 导致的 principled boundary\n4\t  case（SWA/GQA 架构 在 cross-scorer 条件下 15D features 信号不足），128-token 的失败用 DPI 的 minimum\n5\t  mutual information threshold 解释。Pythia T=0.7 的边缘性用 low-temperature channel narrowing\n6\t  解释——temperature 过低导致 vocabulary distribution 预先收窄，减少了 generational degradation 的可测量空间。增加\n7\t  §5.x ''Boundary conditions of universality'' 段落，将三类失败条件（短文本/低温/跨架构 scorer mismatch）统一在\n8\t  DPI framework 下。C1'' 措辞降为 ''K*=2 is a robust discrimination boundary under standard\n9\t  conditions (≥256 tokens, T≥0.9, compatible scorer architecture)''。仍冲 EMNLP Main——14/19\n10\t  primary conditions K*=2 的一致性足够强，且失败条件均有理论预测支撑。Rebuttal 策略：承认 scope + 强调已覆盖条件的 100%\n11\t  一致性 + DPI 预测三类 boundary 的准确性作为理论泛化的证据。\n12\t\n13\t  '\n14\timagined_experiments:\n15\t- name: LLaMA-3.1-8B cross-family depth chain\n16\t  plan_id: exp-018\n17\t  description: 'LLaMA-3.1-8B continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs,\n18\t    depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B。新模型族中表现较好的一个。\n19\t\n20\t    '\n21\t  expected_results:\n22\t    k_star: 2\n23\t    pairwise_auc:\n24\t      0v1: 0.9718\n25\t      1v2: 0.6253\n26\t      2v3: 0.5548\n27\t      3v4: 0.5212\n28\t      4v5: 0.5083\n29\t    pairwise_auc_std:\n30\t      0v1: 0.0028\n31\t      1v2: 0.0092\n32\t      2v3: 0.0058\n33\t      3v4: 0.0095\n34\t      4v5: 0.0071\n35\t    bootstrap_ci:\n36\t      0v1:\n37\t        auc: 0.9718\n38\t        ci_lower: 0.9693\n39\t        ci_upper: 0.9743\n40\t        perm_p: 0.0001\n41\t      1v2:\n42\t        auc: 0.6253\n43\t        ci_lower: 0.6072\n44\t        ci_upper: 0.6434\n45\t        perm_p: 0.0001\n46\t      2v3:\n47\t        auc: 0.5548\n48\t        ci_lower: 0.5447\n49\t        ci_upper: 0.5649\n50\t        perm_p: 0.0001\n51\t      3v4:\n52\t        auc: 0.5212\n53\t        ci_lower: 0.5108\n54\t        ci_upper: 0.5316\n55\t        perm_p: 0.0012\n56\t      4v5:\n57\t        auc: 0.5083\n58\t        ci_lower: 0.4978\n59\t        ci_upper: 0.5188\n60\t        perm_p: 0.0892\n61\t    pairwise_jsd:\n62\t      0v1: 0.1384\n63\t      1v2: 0.0108\n64\t      2v3: 0.0049\n65\t      3v4: 0.0038\n66\t      4v5: 0.0031\n67\t    ordinal_mae: 1.198\n68\t    ordinal_accuracy: 0.357\n69\t    top_features:\n70\t    - freq_entropy\n71\t    - surp_d1_mean\n72\t    - surp_std\n73\t    - surp_d1_skew\n74\t    - hapax_ratio\n75\t  result_rationale: 'LLaMA-3.1-8B 使用 GQA + RoPE 的标准 Transformer 架构，与 Qwen-7B（exp-004）同为\n76\t    7-8B continuation mode + cross-scorer 条件。Qwen-7B 1v2=0.6178（CI lower 0.6079），LLaMA-8B\n77\t    预期略高于 Qwen-7B（0.625 vs 0.618）因为 LLaMA 的训练数据更侧重英文 web text 与 C4 分布更匹配， 生成文本的统计特征与\n78\t    Qwen scorer 的 surprisal 计算有更好的 calibration。但 CI lower 仅 0.607， 比 θ=0.60 高 0.7pp——边缘但\n79\t    robust。0v1 AUC 0.972 低于 ≤1.5B 模型的 0.99+ 是因为 8B 模型 生成文本质量更高，human-gen0 到 gen1 的跨越更小。4v5\n80\t    non-significant（p=0.089）与 Qwen-7B 的 4v5 p=0.0676 pattern 一致——大模型的深层代际几乎不可区分。\n81\t\n82\t    '\n83\t  tables:\n84\t  - title: 'Table: LLaMA-3.1-8B pairwise depth discrimination'\n85\t    columns:\n86\t    - depth_pair\n87\t    - auc\n88\t    - ci_95\n89\t    - perm_p\n90\t    - k_star_boundary\n91\t    rows:\n92\t    - - 0v1\n93\t      - 0.9718\n94\t      - '[0.9693, 0.9743]'\n95\t      - <0.001\n96\t      - '-'\n97\t    - - 1v2\n98\t      - 0.6253\n99\t      - '[0.6072, 0.6434]'\n100\t      - <0.001\n101\t      - K*=2 ✅ (CI lower 0.607>0.60)\n102\t    - - 2v3\n103\t      - 0.5548\n104\t      - '[0.5447, 0.5649]'\n105\t      - <0.001\n106\t      - below θ\n107\t    - - 3v4\n108\t      - 0.5212\n109\t      - '[0.5108, 0.5316]'\n110\t      - '0.001'\n111\t      - '-'\n112\t    - - 4v5\n113\t      - 0.5083\n114\t      - '[0.4978, 0.5188]'\n115\t      - '0.089'\n116\t      - n.s.\n117\t  figures_description:\n118\t  - 'AUC decay curve: 与 Qwen-7B (exp-004) overlay，showing similar decay profile but\n119\t    LLaMA consistently ~0.7pp higher at 1v2'\n120\t  - 'Feature importance bar chart: top-5 features 与 Qwen-7B 共享 4/5（freq_entropy, surp_d1_mean,\n121\t    surp_std, surp_d1_skew），hapax_ratio 替代 surp_mean 进入 top-5'\n122\t  analysis: 'LLaMA-8B 确认 K*=2 在第二个大规模模型族（非 Qwen 系列）上成立。CI lower=0.607 高于 θ 但属 median\n123\t    档预期的边缘范围（0.600-0.607）。与 Qwen-7B 的 CI lower=0.608 高度一致，说明 7-8B 规模 + cross-scorer\n124\t    条件下的 1v2 边界是 systematic 而非 random。Top features 中 hapax_ratio 进入 top-5 是 LLaMA\n125\t    特有——LLaMA 的 BPE 词表与 Qwen 不同，rare token 分布 在 generational degradation 下的变化模式略有差异。但\n126\t    surp_d1_std/surp_std/surp_d2_std 仍在 top-10 内，与 exp-005 的 shared_top_discriminators\n127\t    一致。Paper 可将 LLaMA-8B 作为 universality evidence 的第 6 个独立模型族。\n128\t\n129\t    '\n130\t- name: Mistral-7B-v0.3 cross-family depth chain\n131\t  plan_id: exp-019\n132\t  description: 'Mistral-7B-v0.3 continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs,\n133\t    depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B。新模型族中表现较差的一个，K* 降至 1。\n134\t\n135\t    '\n136\t  expected_results:\n137\t    k_star: 1\n138\t    pairwise_auc:\n139\t      0v1: 0.9681\n140\t      1v2: 0.5934\n141\t      2v3: 0.5487\n142\t      3v4: 0.5195\n143\t      4v5: 0.5068\n144\t    pairwise_auc_std:\n145\t      0v1: 0.0031\n146\t      1v2: 0.0098\n147\t      2v3: 0.0062\n148\t      3v4: 0.0088\n149\t      4v5: 0.0075\n150\t    bootstrap_ci:\n151\t      0v1:\n152\t        auc: 0.9681\n153\t        ci_lower: 0.9652\n154\t        ci_upper: 0.971\n155\t        perm_p: 0.0001\n156\t      1v2:\n157\t        auc: 0.5934\n158\t        ci_lower: 0.5821\n159\t        ci_upper: 0.6047\n160\t        perm_p: 0.0001\n161\t      2v3:\n162\t        auc: 0.5487\n163\t        ci_lower: 0.5382\n164\t        ci_upper: 0.5592\n165\t        perm_p: 0.0001\n166\t      3v4:\n167\t        auc: 0.5195\n168\t        ci_lower: 0.5092\n169\t        ci_upper: 0.5298\n170\t        perm_p: 0.0034\n171\t      4v5:\n172\t        auc: 0.5068\n173\t        ci_lower: 0.4963\n174\t        ci_upper: 0.5173\n175\t        perm_p: 0.134\n176\t    pairwise_jsd:\n177\t      0v1: 0.1312\n178\t      1v2: 0.0079\n179\t      2v3: 0.0044\n180\t      3v4: 0.0035\n181\t      4v5: 0.0028\n182\t    ordinal_mae: 1.241\n183\t    ordinal_accuracy: 0.342\n184\t    top_features:\n185\t    - surp_d1_mean\n186\t    - freq_entropy\n187\t    - surp_std\n188\t    - surp_mean\n189\t    - surp_d1_skew\n190\t  result_rationale: 'Mistral-7B-v0.3 是 median 档的核心 boundary case。1v2 AUC=0.593，CI\n191\t    lower=0.582， CI upper=0.605——CI 上界刚好跨过 θ=0.60 但下界远低于阈值。K*=1 的根因分析：(1) Mistral\n192\t    的 GQA(8 heads) + 大 vocabulary (32K) 组合意味着每个 generation step 的 information loss\n193\t    rate 低于 Pythia/OLMo——Mistral 是一个更\"高保真\"的 iterated channel，DPI 预测 K*_theory 更高但\n194\t    K*_empirical 被 15D features 的检测灵敏度 cap 住；(2) cross-scorer 条件（Qwen-1.5B 计算 surprisal）引入\n195\t    tokenizer/architecture mismatch——Mistral 使用 SentencePiece BPE 而 Qwen 使用 不同的 BPE\n196\t    scheme，相同文本的 token boundary 不同导致 surprisal-derived features 精度降低； (3) JSD 1v2=0.0079\n197\t    是所有模型中最低的（Pythia 0.014, OLMo 0.013, Qwen-cont 0.005 但 Qwen-cont 是 self-scorer），说明\n198\t    gen1→gen2 的分布变化确实很小。论文定位：Mistral 不是 counterexample 而是 principled boundary——它验证了\n199\t    DPI 框架的预测，即高容量低损耗模型的 K*_empirical 受限于 feature 灵敏度而非信号不存在。exp-015 的 neural probe\n200\t    结果（neural representations 比 15D 多辨别 1 个深度）暗示如果用 Mistral 自身 embeddings 做 probe\n201\t    可能恢复 K*=2。\n202\t\n203\t    '\n204\t  tables:\n205\t  - title: 'Table: Mistral-7B pairwise depth discrimination'\n206\t    columns:\n207\t    - depth_pair\n208\t    - auc\n209\t    - ci_95\n210\t    - perm_p\n211\t    - k_star_boundary\n212\t    rows:\n213\t    - - 0v1\n214\t      - 0.9681\n215\t      - '[0.9652, 0.9710]'\n216\t      - <0.001\n217\t      - '-'\n218\t    - - 1v2\n219\t      - 0.5934\n220\t      - '[0.5821, 0.6047]'\n221\t      - <0.001\n222\t      - K*=1 ❌ (CI lower 0.582<0.60)\n223\t    - - 2v3\n224\t      - 0.5487\n225\t      - '[0.5382, 0.5592]'\n226\t      - <0.001\n227\t      - below θ\n228\t    - - 3v4\n229\t      - 0.5195\n230\t      - '[0.5092, 0.5298]'\n231\t      - '0.003'\n232\t      - '-'\n233\t    - - 4v5\n234\t      - 0.5068\n235\t      - '[0.4963, 0.5173]'\n236\t      - '0.134'\n237\t      - n.s.\n238\t  - title: 'Table: New model family comparison'\n239\t    columns:\n240\t    - model\n241\t    - 1v2_auc\n242\t    - ci_lower\n243\t    - k_star\n244\t    - scorer\n245\t    rows:\n246\t    - - LLaMA-3.1-8B\n247\t      - 0.6253\n248\t      - 0.6072\n249\t      - 2\n250\t      - Qwen-1.5B\n251\t    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n252\t      - 0.5934\n253\t      - 0.5821\n254\t      - 1\n255\t      - Qwen-1.5B\n256\t    - - Qwen2.5-7B (exp-004)\n257\t      - 0.6178\n258\t      - 0.6079\n259\t      - 2\n260\t      - Qwen-1.5B\n261\t    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B base (exp-016)\n262\t      - 0.6262\n263\t      - 0.6168\n264\t      - 2\n265\t      - self\n266\t  figures_description:\n267\t  - 'AUC decay comparison across all 7-8B models: LLaMA, Mistral, Qwen-7B overlay\n268\t    showing Mistral''s flatter decay curve (lower information loss rate)'\n269\t  - 'JSD heatmap: Mistral''s 1v2 JSD visibly lowest among all models, linking to DPI\n270\t    channel capacity interpretation'\n271\t  analysis: 'Mistral K*=1 是 median 档的 defining result。论文处理策略：(1) 在 §4.1 universality\n272\t    结果表中 标注 Mistral 为 boundary case（CI upper 0.605 跨 θ）；(2) 在 §5.x Boundary Conditions\n273\t    段落中分析三个 contributing factors（low info loss rate, cross-scorer tokenizer mismatch,\n274\t    feature sensitivity ceiling）；(3) 引用 DPI 理论论证 K*_theory ≥ 2 但 K*_empirical 受限于\n275\t    measurement precision——类比物理实验中测量精度与真实值的关系；(4) 与 exp-015 neural probe 结果对照，论证更精细的\n276\t    representation 可能恢复更高 K*。关键 rebuttal 准备：如果 reviewer 说 \"Mistral 证伪了 universality\"，回应\n277\t    1v2 AUC=0.593 仍远高于 chance (0.50)，信号存在但 被 θ=0.60 阈值 cut off——这是 operational threshold\n278\t    choice 而非 physical boundary。\n279\t\n280\t    '\n281\t- name: Pythia-1.4B decoding strategy ablation\n282\t  plan_id: exp-020\n283\t  description: 'Pythia-1.4B 上复现 exp-003 的解码策略实验（greedy / nucleus p=0.9 / T=0.7 / T=1.2），\n284\t    验证解码不变性是否跨模型成立。3/4 配置确认 K*=2，T=0.7 边缘。\n285\t\n286\t    '\n287\t  expected_results:\n288\t    config1_greedy:\n289\t      k_star: 2\n290\t      pairwise_auc:\n291\t        0v1: 0.9748\n292\t        1v2: 0.6482\n293\t        2v3: 0.5504\n294\t        3v4: 0.5163\n295\t        4v5: 0.5098\n296\t      bootstrap_ci:\n297\t        1v2:\n298\t          auc: 0.6482\n299\t          ci_lower: 0.6378\n300\t          ci_upper: 0.6586\n301\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n302\t        2v3:\n303\t          auc: 0.5504\n304\t          ci_lower: 0.5401\n305\t          ci_upper: 0.5607\n306\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n307\t    config2_nuc09:\n308\t      k_star: 2\n309\t      pairwise_auc:\n310\t        0v1: 0.9911\n311\t        1v2: 0.6397\n312\t        2v3: 0.5468\n313\t        3v4: 0.5138\n314\t        4v5: 0.5072\n315\t      bootstrap_ci:\n316\t        1v2:\n317\t          auc: 0.6397\n318\t          ci_lower: 0.6271\n319\t          ci_upper: 0.6523\n320\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n321\t        2v3:\n322\t          auc: 0.5468\n323\t          ci_lower: 0.5363\n324\t          ci_upper: 0.5573\n325\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n326\t    config3_t07:\n327\t      k_star: 1\n328\t      pairwise_auc:\n329\t        0v1: 0.9812\n330\t        1v2: 0.6118\n331\t        2v3: 0.5472\n332\t        3v4: 0.5186\n333\t        4v5: 0.5114\n334\t      bootstrap_ci:\n335\t        1v2:\n336\t          auc: 0.6118\n337\t          ci_lower: 0.5973\n338\t          ci_upper: 0.6263\n339\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n340\t        2v3:\n341\t          auc: 0.5472\n342\t          ci_lower: 0.5368\n343\t          ci_upper: 0.5576\n344\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n345\t    config4_t12:\n346\t      k_star: 2\n347\t      pairwise_auc:\n348\t        0v1: 0.9967\n349\t        1v2: 0.6648\n350\t        2v3: 0.5537\n351\t        3v4: 0.5171\n352\t        4v5: 0.5126\n353\t      bootstrap_ci:\n354\t        1v2:\n355\t          auc: 0.6648\n356\t          ci_lower: 0.6542\n357\t          ci_upper: 0.6754\n358\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n359\t        2v3:\n360\t          auc: 0.5537\n361\t          ci_lower: 0.5432\n362\t          ci_upper: 0.5642\n363\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n364\t    kstar2_fraction: 0.75\n365\t    summary:\n366\t      all_0v1_above_097: true\n367\t      all_2v3_below_060: true\n368\t      t07_ci_lower: 0.5973\n369\t      t07_marginal_note: CI lower 0.597 < θ=0.60 by 0.3pp\n370\t  result_rationale: 'Pythia-1.4B 的 baseline 1v2 AUC=0.6539（nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0），比\n371\t    Qwen 的 baseline 低约 4-8pp（Qwen-rw 0.696, Qwen-cont 0.611）。在 Qwen 上 4/4 decoding\n372\t    configs 均 K*=2 是因为 Qwen 的 1v2 signal 有足够 headroom（最低 0.686）。Pythia 的 headroom\n373\t    更小。 T=0.7 成为 edge case 的机制：低温使 Pythia 的 token selection 更集中在高概率区域，每代 生成文本的 vocabulary\n374\t    distribution 已经被 temperature 预先收窄（entropy reduction）， 留给 generational degradation\n375\t    的可测量空间减少。具体来说，T=0.7 下 freq_entropy 和 hapax_ratio 的 baseline variance 更低，surp_std\n376\t    的 depth-wise gradient 变平——这些 恰好是 1v2 discrimination 的关键 features。CI lower=0.597\n377\t    仅低于 θ 0.3pp，属于 measurement noise 边界。T=1.2 给出最高 1v2（0.665）因为高温放大了 generation noise，\n378\t    加速信息损失→1v2 contrast 增强。Greedy（0.648）高于 nucleus p=0.9（0.640）因为 greedy 的完全确定性使得\n379\t    generational drift 在 repetition/diversity features 上 更容易被捕捉。\n380\t\n381\t    '\n382\t  tables:\n383\t  - title: 'Table: Pythia decoding ablation pairwise AUC'\n384\t    columns:\n385\t    - config\n386\t    - 0v1\n387\t    - 1v2\n388\t    - 1v2 CI\n389\t    - 2v3\n390\t    - k_star\n391\t    rows:\n392\t    - - greedy\n393\t      - 0.9748\n394\t      - 0.6482\n395\t      - '[0.638, 0.659]'\n396\t      - 0.5504\n397\t      - 2 ✅\n398\t    - - nuc p=0.9\n399\t      - 0.9911\n400\t      - 0.6397\n401\t      - '[0.627, 0.652]'\n402\t      - 0.5468\n403\t      - 2 ✅\n404\t    - - T=0.7\n405\t      - 0.9812\n406\t      - 0.6118\n407\t      - '[0.597, 0.626]'\n408\t      - 0.5472\n409\t      - 1 ⚠️\n410\t    - - T=1.2\n411\t      - 0.9967\n412\t      - 0.6648\n413\t      - '[0.654, 0.675]'\n414\t      - 0.5537\n415\t      - 2 ✅\n416\t  - title: 'Table: Qwen (exp-003) vs Pythia (exp-020) decoding comparison'\n417\t    columns:\n418\t    - config\n419\t    - qwen_1v2\n420\t    - pythia_1v2\n421\t    - delta\n422\t    - both_kstar2\n423\t    rows:\n424\t    - - greedy\n425\t      - 0.6892\n426\t      - 0.6482\n427\t      - -4.1pp\n428\t      - ✅\n429\t    - - nuc p=0.9\n430\t      - 0.6862\n431\t      - 0.6397\n432\t      - -4.7pp\n433\t      - ✅\n434\t    - - T=0.7\n435\t      - 0.6885\n436\t      - 0.6118\n437\t      - -7.7pp\n438\t      - ❌ (Pythia fails)\n439\t    - - T=1.2\n440\t      - 0.7037\n441\t      - 0.6648\n442\t      - -3.9pp\n443\t      - ✅\n444\t  figures_description:\n445\t  - 'Side-by-side AUC decay curves: Qwen (exp-003) vs Pythia (exp-020) for each decoding\n446\t    config, highlighting T=0.7 divergence'\n447\t  - 'Temperature vs 1v2 AUC scatter: both models show positive correlation, Pythia\n448\t    curve shifted ~4-5pp lower'\n449\t  analysis: '3/4 K*=2 的结果使 decoding invariance claim 从 \"absolute\" 降级为 \"robust under\n450\t    standard conditions\"。T=0.7 的失败是 model-specific：Qwen T=0.7 的 1v2=0.689 远高于阈值（CI\n451\t    lower 0.680），但 Pythia T=0.7 仅 0.612（CI lower 0.597）。Qwen→Pythia 的 delta 在 T=0.7\n452\t    时最大（-7.7pp vs 其他 config 的 -3.9 到 -4.7pp），说明 Pythia 对低温更敏感——可能因为 Pythia 的 vocabulary\n453\t    size 更小（50K vs Qwen 的 151K），低温下的 effective vocabulary 收窄更剧烈。论文处理：在 §4.x Decoding\n454\t    段落中报告 7/8 跨模型×decoding configs K*=2， T=0.7 × Pythia 作为 boundary case 放入 §5.x。措辞\n455\t    \"K*=2 is invariant to decoding strategy for T≥0.9; at T=0.7, model-dependent sensitivity\n456\t    emerges\"。\n457\t\n458\t    '\n459\t- name: Text length ablation (128/256/512 tokens)\n460\t  plan_id: exp-021\n461\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct continuation, 三个文本长度（128/256/512 tokens），验证\n462\t    K* 的 minimum information requirement。128-token 预期 K*=1。\n463\t\n464\t    '\n465\t  expected_results:\n466\t    length_128:\n467\t      k_star: 1\n468\t      pairwise_auc:\n469\t        0v1: 0.9893\n470\t        1v2: 0.5902\n471\t        2v3: 0.5481\n472\t        3v4: 0.5327\n473\t        4v5: 0.5189\n474\t      bootstrap_ci:\n475\t        0v1:\n476\t          auc: 0.9893\n477\t          ci_lower: 0.9872\n478\t          ci_upper: 0.9914\n479\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n480\t        1v2:\n481\t          auc: 0.5902\n482\t          ci_lower: 0.5762\n483\t          ci_upper: 0.6042\n484\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n485\t        2v3:\n486\t          auc: 0.5481\n487\t          ci_lower: 0.5342\n488\t          ci_upper: 0.562\n489\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n490\t        3v4:\n491\t          auc: 0.5327\n492\t          ci_lower: 0.5188\n493\t          ci_upper: 0.5466\n494\t          perm_p: 0.0008\n495\t        4v5:\n496\t          auc: 0.5189\n497\t          ci_lower: 0.505\n498\t          ci_upper: 0.5328\n499\t          perm_p: 0.0243\n500\t      pairwise_jsd:\n501\t        0v1: 0.2614\n502\t        1v2: 0.0038\n503\t        2v3: 0.0029\n504\t        3v4: 0.0024\n505\t        4v5: 0.0021\n506\t      ordinal_mae: 1.223\n507\t      ordinal_accuracy: 0.361\n508\t    length_256:\n509\t      k_star: 2\n510\t      pairwise_auc:\n511\t        0v1: 0.9948\n512\t        1v2: 0.6187\n513\t        2v3: 0.5572\n514\t        3v4: 0.5378\n515\t        4v5: 0.5148\n516\t      bootstrap_ci:\n517\t        0v1:\n518\t          auc: 0.9948\n519\t          ci_lower: 0.9937\n520\t          ci_upper: 0.9959\n521\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n522\t        1v2:\n523\t          auc: 0.6187\n524\t          ci_lower: 0.6078\n525\t          ci_upper: 0.6296\n526\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n527\t        2v3:\n528\t          auc: 0.5572\n529\t          ci_lower: 0.5467\n530\t          ci_upper: 0.5677\n531\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n532\t        3v4:\n533\t          auc: 0.5378\n534\t          ci_lower: 0.5273\n535\t          ci_upper: 0.5483\n536\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n537\t        4v5:\n538\t          auc: 0.5148\n539\t          ci_lower: 0.5043\n540\t          ci_upper: 0.5253\n541\t          perm_p: 0.0052\n542\t      pairwise_jsd:\n543\t        0v1: 0.2748\n544\t        1v2: 0.0046\n545\t        2v3: 0.0033\n546\t        3v4: 0.003\n547\t        4v5: 0.0027\n548\t      ordinal_mae: 1.172\n549\t      ordinal_accuracy: 0.375\n550\t    length_512:\n551\t      k_star: 2\n552\t      pairwise_auc:\n553\t        0v1: 0.9971\n554\t        1v2: 0.6341\n555\t        2v3: 0.5632\n556\t        3v4: 0.5413\n557\t        4v5: 0.5156\n558\t      bootstrap_ci:\n559\t        0v1:\n560\t          auc: 0.9971\n561\t          ci_lower: 0.9963\n562\t          ci_upper: 0.9979\n563\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n564\t        1v2:\n565\t          auc: 0.6341\n566\t          ci_lower: 0.6228\n567\t          ci_upper: 0.6454\n568\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n569\t        2v3:\n570\t          auc: 0.5632\n571\t          ci_lower: 0.5529\n572\t          ci_upper: 0.5735\n573\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n574\t        3v4:\n575\t          auc: 0.5413\n576\t          ci_lower: 0.531\n577\t          ci_upper: 0.5516\n578\t          perm_p: 0.0001\n579\t        4v5:\n580\t          auc: 0.5156\n581\t          ci_lower: 0.5051\n582\t          ci_upper: 0.5261\n583\t          perm_p: 0.0041\n584\t      pairwise_jsd:\n585\t        0v1: 0.2871\n586\t        1v2: 0.0052\n587\t        2v3: 0.0036\n588\t        3v4: 0.0032\n589\t        4v5: 0.0029\n590\t      ordinal_mae: 1.148\n591\t      ordinal_accuracy: 0.384\n592\t    length_effect_summary:\n593\t      auc_1v2_by_length:\n594\t        128: 0.5902\n595\t        256: 0.6187\n596\t        512: 0.6341\n597\t      kstar_by_length:\n598\t        128: 1\n599\t        256: 2\n600\t        512: 2\n601\t      minimum_length_for_kstar2: 256\n602\t  result_rationale: '128-token K*=1 的根因是统计估计器的 sample size 效应，而非 depth signal 不存在。15D\n603\t    features 中的 distributional statistics（freq_entropy 基于 unigram 频率分布，hapax_ratio\n604\t    基于 unique token 比例，surp_std/surp_skew 基于 surprisal 分布的高阶矩）在 128 tokens 下 有极高的\n605\t    estimation variance。以 hapax_ratio 为例：128 tokens 中 ~80-100 unique tokens， hapax\n606\t    数量的 Poisson 噪声使得 depth 0 和 depth 1 的 hapax_ratio 分布严重重叠。 surp_std 的 standard error\n607\t    在 n=128 时约为 σ/√(128) ≈ σ/11.3，而 n=512 时约为 σ/22.6， precision 差 2 倍。JSD 1v2 从 512（0.0052）到\n608\t    128（0.0038）的下降（-27%）直接反映了 这个 estimation noise 效应。1v2 AUC=0.5902 的 CI upper=0.6042\n609\t    刚过 θ=0.60，说明 信号存在但 buried in noise。256 tokens 是 minimum viable length（CI lower=0.608\n610\t    > 0.60 且 margin 合理）。512→默认长度（exp-017 使用的长度）时 AUC 进一步提升至 0.634，但 256→512 的增量（+1.5pp）远小于\n611\t    128→256 的增量（+2.9pp），说明 256 已捕获主要 statistical precision gains。DPI interpretation：每个\n612\t    generation step 的 mutual information loss 是 per-token 的常数 ε，但 15D features 只能在\n613\t    aggregate statistics 上测量——aggregate 的 precision 需要 sufficient sample size，128\n614\t    tokens 低于这个 threshold。\n615\t\n616\t    '\n617\t  tables:\n618\t  - title: 'Table: Length ablation summary'\n619\t    columns:\n620\t    - length\n621\t    - 1v2_auc\n622\t    - 1v2 CI\n623\t    - 1v2_jsd\n624\t    - k_star\n625\t    - feature CI width (mean)\n626\t    rows:\n627\t    - - 128\n628\t      - 0.5902\n629\t      - '[0.576, 0.604]'\n630\t      - 0.0038\n631\t      - 1 ❌\n632\t      - ±0.014\n633\t    - - 256\n634\t      - 0.6187\n635\t      - '[0.608, 0.630]'\n636\t      - 0.0046\n637\t      - 2 ✅\n638\t      - ±0.011\n639\t    - - 512\n640\t      - 0.6341\n641\t      - '[0.623, 0.645]'\n642\t      - 0.0052\n643\t      - 2 ✅\n644\t      - ±0.008\n645\t  - title: 'Table: Per-feature AUC at 1v2 by length'\n646\t    columns:\n647\t    - feature\n648\t    - auc_128\n649\t    - auc_256\n650\t    - auc_512\n651\t    rows:\n652\t    - - freq_entropy\n653\t      - 0.554\n654\t      - 0.571\n655\t      - 0.582\n656\t    - - surp_std\n657\t      - 0.548\n658\t      - 0.565\n659\t      - 0.578\n660\t    - - surp_d1_std\n661\t      - 0.542\n662\t      - 0.558\n663\t      - 0.573\n664\t    - - hapax_ratio\n665\t      - 0.536\n666\t      - 0.555\n667\t      - 0.569\n668\t    - - ttr\n669\t      - 0.533\n670\t      - 0.551\n671\t      - 0.566\n672\t  figures_description:\n673\t  - 'Length vs 1v2 AUC curve with CI bands: showing monotonic increase with diminishing\n674\t    returns, vertical line at 256 marking ''minimum viable length'''\n675\t  - 'Feature-level AUC heatmap (length × feature × depth pair): 128-token row visibly\n676\t    noisier with wider CI bands'\n677\t  - 'Bootstrap CI width vs length: demonstrating √n scaling of precision'\n678\t  analysis: 'Length ablation 的关键贡献：(1) 建立 K* 的 minimum information requirement（≥256\n679\t    tokens）， 将 universality claim 的 scope 精确化；(2) 提供 DPI framework 的 quantitative\n680\t    validation ——如果 per-token information loss 是常数 ε，则 aggregate MI scales with n，预测\n681\t    longer text → higher K*_empirical（or at least more precise measurement），实验数据完美符合；\n682\t    (3) 为 practitioner 提供 actionable guidance——对 128 tokens 以下的短文本不应尝试 depth estimation。128-token\n683\t    的 CI upper=0.604 跨过 θ 但 lower=0.576 远低于——如果 θ 设为 0.575 则 128 tokens 也 \"pass\"，但这样会让其他多个条件变得不可靠。这进一步证明\n684\t    θ=0.60 是 well-calibrated 的 operational threshold。\n685\t\n686\t    '\n687\t- name: 4×4 cross-scorer matrix\n688\t  plan_id: exp-022\n689\t  description: '4 generators × 4 scorers 完整交叉验证，量化 scorer independence。重现 exp_A 中的\n690\t    scorer-dependence 模式但在更大矩阵上验证其可控性。\n691\t\n692\t    '\n693\t  expected_results:\n694\t    generators:\n695\t    - Qwen-1.5B-cont\n696\t    - Pythia-1.4B\n697\t    - OLMo-1B\n698\t    - Qwen2.5-7B\n699\t    scorers:\n700\t    - Qwen-1.5B\n701\t    - Pythia-1.4B\n702\t    - OLMo-1B\n703\t    - Qwen2.5-7B\n704\t    kstar_matrix:\n705\t      Qwen1.5_Qwen1.5: 2\n706\t      Qwen1.5_Pythia: 1\n707\t      Qwen1.5_OLMo: 1\n708\t      Qwen1.5_Qwen7B: 2\n709\t      Pythia_Qwen1.5: 2\n710\t      Pythia_Pythia: 2\n711\t      Pythia_OLMo: 2\n712\t      Pythia_Qwen7B: 2\n713\t      OLMo_Qwen1.5: 2\n714\t      OLMo_Pythia: 2\n715\t      OLMo_OLMo: 2\n716\t      OLMo_Qwen7B: 2\n717\t      Qwen7B_Qwen1.5: 2\n718\t      Qwen7B_Pythia: 1\n719\t      Qwen7B_OLMo: 1\n720\t      Qwen7B_Qwen7B: 2\n721\t    kstar2_count: 12\n722\t    kstar2_fraction: 0.75\n723\t    auc_1v2_matrix:\n724\t      Qwen1.5_Qwen1.5: 0.6114\n725\t      Qwen1.5_Pythia: 0.5887\n726\t      Qwen1.5_OLMo: 0.5843\n727\t      Qwen1.5_Qwen7B: 0.6078\n728\t      Pythia_Qwen1.5: 0.6412\n729\t      Pythia_Pythia: 0.6539\n730\t      Pythia_OLMo: 0.6361\n731\t      Pythia_Qwen7B: 0.6387\n732\t      OLMo_Qwen1.5: 0.6058\n733\t      OLMo_Pythia: 0.6127\n734\t      OLMo_OLMo: 0.6146\n735\t      OLMo_Qwen7B: 0.6093\n736\t      Qwen7B_Qwen1.5: 0.6178\n737\t      Qwen7B_Pythia: 0.5932\n738\t      Qwen7B_OLMo: 0.5891\n739\t      Qwen7B_Qwen7B: 0.6248\n740\t    self_scorer_avg_1v2: 0.6262\n741\t    cross_scorer_avg_1v2: 0.6095\n742\t    cross_scorer_delta: -0.0167\n743\t    feature_ranking_spearman_across_scorers:\n744\t      mean_rho: 0.912\n745\t      min_rho: 0.873\n746\t      max_rho: 0.958\n747\t  result_rationale: 'Cross-scorer matrix 重现 exp_A 的核心 pattern：K* 主要由 generator 决定而非\n748\t    scorer， 但 generator-scorer 之间的 architectural distance 调制 signal strength。12/16\n749\t    K*=2 （0.75）在 median 指标范围 [0.6, 0.85] 内。4 个 K*=1 failure 的结构化分析： (1) Qwen-1.5B-cont\n750\t    作为 generator 被 Pythia/OLMo scored 时 K*=1——Qwen-cont 的 1v2 signal 本身最弱（self-scored\n751\t    仅 0.611，CI lower 0.6015），cross-scorer 增加的 noise（~-2pp）足以将其推到 θ 以下；(2) Qwen-7B\n752\t    被 Pythia/OLMo scored 时 K*=1—— 同理，7B 模型的 self-scored 1v2=0.618 已在边缘，加上 7B→1.4B/1B\n753\t    scorer 的 scale mismatch（smaller scorer 的 surprisal resolution 不足以捕捉 7B 模型的精细 depth\n754\t    signal）。注意 Pythia 和 OLMo 作为 generator 时完全 robust（4/4 scorers 都 K*=2）， 因为它们的 self-scored\n755\t    1v2 较高（0.654 和 0.615）且与其他模型的 architectural distance 较小。Feature ranking ρ≥0.87\n756\t    跨所有 scorer 组合，确认 exp_A 的 ρ≥0.90 finding 在完整矩阵上 hold（略低因为 include 了更多 distant pairs）。\n757\t\n758\t    '\n759\t  tables:\n760\t  - title: 'Table: K* cross-scorer matrix (generator × scorer)'\n761\t    columns:\n762\t    - generator_scorer\n763\t    - Qwen-1.5B\n764\t    - Pythia-1.4B\n765\t    - OLMo-1B\n766\t    - Qwen-7B\n767\t    rows:\n768\t    - - Qwen-1.5B-cont\n769\t      - K*=2 (0.611)\n770\t      - K*=1 (0.589)\n771\t      - K*=1 (0.584)\n772\t      - K*=2 (0.608)\n773\t    - - Pythia-1.4B\n774\t      - K*=2 (0.641)\n775\t      - K*=2 (0.654)\n776\t      - K*=2 (0.636)\n777\t      - K*=2 (0.639)\n778\t    - - OLMo-1B\n779\t      - K*=2 (0.606)\n780\t      - K*=2 (0.613)\n781\t      - K*=2 (0.615)\n782\t      - K*=2 (0.609)\n783\t    - - Qwen-7B\n784\t      - K*=2 (0.618)\n785\t      - K*=1 (0.593)\n786\t      - K*=1 (0.589)\n787\t      - K*=2 (0.625)\n788\t  - title: 'Table: Cross-scorer feature ranking consistency'\n789\t    columns:\n790\t    - scorer_pair\n791\t    - spearman_rho\n792\t    - p_value\n793\t    rows:\n794\t    - - Qwen-1.5B vs Pythia\n795\t      - 0.921\n796\t      - <0.001\n797\t    - - Qwen-1.5B vs OLMo\n798\t      - 0.908\n799\t      - <0.001\n800\t    - - Qwen-1.5B vs Qwen-7B\n801\t      - 0.958\n802\t      - <0.001\n803\t    - - Pythia vs OLMo\n804\t      - 0.947\n805\t      - <0.001\n806\t    - - Pythia vs Qwen-7B\n807\t      - 0.896\n808\t      - <0.001\n809\t    - - OLMo vs Qwen-7B\n810\t      - 0.873\n811\t      - <0.001\n812\t  figures_description:\n813\t  - 'K* heatmap (4×4): color-coded by K* value, with 1v2 AUC annotated in each cell.\n814\t    Clear pattern: diagonal and Pythia/OLMo rows green, Qwen rows mixed'\n815\t  - '1v2 AUC heatmap: showing the systematic ~2pp cross-scorer penalty and generator-specific\n816\t    baseline differences'\n817\t  - 'Feature ranking Spearman ρ network graph: nodes=scorers, edge thickness=ρ, all\n818\t    edges ≥0.87'\n819\t  analysis: '12/16 K*=2 足以支撑 scorer independence claim（with scope）。论文措辞：\"K*=2 is scorer-\n820\t    independent for generators with self-scored 1v2 AUC ≥ 0.63 (Pythia, OLMo); for\n821\t    marginal generators (Qwen-cont, Qwen-7B with self-scored 1v2 AUC ≈ 0.61-0.62),\n822\t    cross-scorer noise can push measurements below θ\"。这与 exp_A 的 K*=1 finding（Qwen-cont\n823\t    cross-scored）完全一致。实际意义：实践者可以用任意 scorer 模型，只要 target generator 的 depth signal 不在阈值边缘。Feature\n824\t    ranking ρ≥0.87 强化了 \"scorer 影响的是 magnitude 而非 feature structure\" 的论点。与 exp-013（cross-model\n825\t    transfer）对照：exp-013 的 cross-model transfer retention 80-92% 测量的是 classifier 的\n826\t    generalization，exp-022 测量的是 feature computation 的 scorer-dependence——两者从不同角度确认\n827\t    depth signal 主要是 text-intrinsic。\n828\t\n829\t    '\n830\t- name: Retrain-chain ecological validity\n831\t  plan_id: exp-008\n832\t  description: 'Pythia-1.4B LoRA retrain-chain (rank=16, alpha=32), depth 0-4, 与 prompt-chain\n833\t    对比验证 ecological validity。\n834\t\n835\t    '\n836\t  expected_results:\n837\t    k_star: 2\n838\t    pairwise_auc:\n839\t      0v1: 0.9847\n840\t      1v2: 0.6312\n841\t      2v3: 0.5583\n842\t      3v4: 0.5224\n843\t    pairwise_auc_std:\n844\t      0v1: 0.0019\n845\t      1v2: 0.0085\n846\t      2v3: 0.0072\n847\t      3v4: 0.0098\n848\t    bootstrap_ci:\n849\t      0v1:\n850\t        auc: 0.9847\n851\t        ci_lower: 0.9822\n852\t        ci_upper: 0.9872\n853\t        perm_p: 0.0001\n854\t      1v2:\n855\t        auc: 0.6312\n856\t        ci_lower: 0.6187\n857\t        ci_upper: 0.6437\n858\t        perm_p: 0.0001\n859\t      2v3:\n860\t        auc: 0.5583\n861\t        ci_lower: 0.5472\n862\t        ci_upper: 0.5694\n863\t        perm_p: 0.0001\n864\t      3v4:\n865\t        auc: 0.5224\n866\t        ci_lower: 0.5108\n867\t        ci_upper: 0.534\n868\t        perm_p: 0.0018\n869\t    prompt_vs_retrain_comparison:\n870\t      prompt_chain_1v2: 0.6539\n871\t      retrain_chain_1v2: 0.6312\n872\t      delta: -0.0227\n873\t      feature_spearman_rho: 0.841\n874\t      shared_top3: true\n875\t    ordinal_mae: 1.152\n876\t    ordinal_accuracy: 0.372\n877\t  result_rationale: 'Retrain-chain K*=2 确认了 prompt-chain 的 ecological validity，但 1v2\n878\t    AUC 低 2.3pp （0.631 vs 0.654）。差异的机制：LoRA rank=16 仅修改模型参数空间的一个低秩子空间， 每代 fine-tuning\n879\t    的 distribution shift 比 prompt-chain 更 gradual（prompt-chain 中 每代的 output distribution\n880\t    是 model(model(...)) 的嵌套，信息损失是 multiplicative； retrain-chain 的损失是 parameter-space\n881\t    的 additive drift，被 LoRA 的低秩约束抑制）。 Feature ranking Spearman ρ=0.84（vs prompt-chain），top-3\n882\t    features 共享（surp_d1_std, surp_std, surp_d2_std），说明两种 chain 的 degradation mechanism\n883\t    虽然不同但在 feature space 上高度一致。0v1 AUC=0.985 略低于 prompt-chain 的 0.993——retrain-chain\n884\t    的 gen1 更接近 human text（因为模型是在 human text 上 fine-tune 后再 generate，而非直接 prompt model\n885\t    to continue）。\n886\t\n887\t    '\n888\t  tables:\n889\t  - title: 'Table: Prompt-chain vs retrain-chain comparison (Pythia-1.4B)'\n890\t    columns:\n891\t    - chain_type\n892\t    - 0v1\n893\t    - 1v2\n894\t    - 2v3\n895\t    - 3v4\n896\t    - k_star\n897\t    - feature_ρ\n898\t    rows:\n899\t    - - prompt-chain\n900\t      - 0.9932\n901\t      - 0.6539\n902\t      - 0.5515\n903\t      - 0.5153\n904\t      - 2\n905\t      - '-'\n906\t    - - retrain-chain\n907\t      - 0.9847\n908\t      - 0.6312\n909\t      - 0.5583\n910\t      - 0.5224\n911\t      - 2\n912\t      - 0.841\n913\t  figures_description:\n914\t  - 'AUC decay curves: prompt-chain vs retrain-chain overlay, showing parallel but\n915\t    offset decay profiles'\n916\t  - 'Feature importance comparison: side-by-side bar charts highlighting shared top\n917\t    discriminators'\n918\t  analysis: 'Ecological validity confirmed: K*=2 和 top features 在两种 chain type 间一致。1v2\n919\t    的 -2.3pp gap 可解释为 LoRA 的 information-preserving bias（低秩约束 = 正则化 = 更慢 的 degradation）。论文定位：supporting\n920\t    experiment，在 §4.1 的 footnote 或 Appendix 中报告。为 reviewer concern #3（\"prompt-chain\n921\t    不代表真实污染\"）提供直接回应。 注意 depth 仅到 4（非 5），因为 retrain-chain 的 GPU cost 更高（每代需要 fine-tune）。\n922\t\n923\t    '\n924\t- name: Contamination dose-response\n925\t  plan_id: exp-009\n926\t  description: '在 10%/30%/50% synthetic injection 比例下，比较 binary vs graduated filtering\n927\t    的 downstream benefit scaling。\n928\t\n929\t    '\n930\t  expected_results:\n931\t    dose_10pct:\n932\t      binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5879\n933\t      graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5876\n934\t      no_filter_mmlu: 0.5873\n935\t      binary_vs_nofilter_delta: +0.06pp\n936\t      binary_vs_graduated_p: 0.42\n937\t    dose_30pct:\n938\t      binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5912\n939\t      graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5897\n940\t      no_filter_mmlu: 0.5858\n941\t      binary_vs_nofilter_delta: +0.54pp\n942\t      binary_vs_graduated_p: 0.08\n943\t    dose_50pct:\n944\t      binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5941\n945\t      graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5892\n946\t      no_filter_mmlu: 0.5865\n947\t      binary_vs_nofilter_delta: +0.76pp\n948\t      binary_vs_graduated_p: 0.003\n949\t    dose_response_slope:\n950\t      binary_benefit_per_10pct: +0.016pp MMLU\n951\t      graduated_gap_widens: true\n952\t    key_finding: binary advantage scales with contamination dose; graduated never\n953\t      outperforms binary at any dose level\n954\t  result_rationale: 'Dose-response 结果直接从 K*=2 的 information-theoretic implication\n955\t    推导：因为 K*=2， depth ≥2 的文本与 depth 1 的文本在 feature space 中几乎不可区分，所以 graduated weighting\n956\t    （试图利用 fine-grained depth signal beyond K*）无法比 binary filtering（只区分 depth 0 vs\n957\t    depth ≥1）做得更好。在低 contamination dose（10%）时，filtering 的 absolute benefit 极小（~0.06pp\n958\t    MMLU），因为 contaminated fraction 本身很小——这使得所有策略的 difference 在统计噪声中不可分辨（p=0.42）。随着\n959\t    dose 增加到 30% 和 50%，binary filtering 的优势 开始统计显著（50% dose: p=0.003），因为有更多 contaminated\n960\t    samples 可被正确过滤。 Graduated 在 50% dose 时的 MMLU（0.5892）与 exp-006 完全一致（实验复现）。 Binary-vs-graduated\n961\t    gap 从 10%（+0.03pp, n.s.）扩大到 50%（+0.49pp, p=0.003）， 说明 graduated 的 over-fitting\n962\t    to noise beyond K* 在高 contamination 下更有害。\n963\t\n964\t    '\n965\t  tables:\n966\t  - title: 'Table: Dose-response MMLU comparison'\n967\t    columns:\n968\t    - dose\n969\t    - binary_ours\n970\t    - graduated_a09\n971\t    - no_filter\n972\t    - binary vs no-filter Δ\n973\t    - binary vs grad p\n974\t    rows:\n975\t    - - 10%\n976\t      - 0.5879\n977\t      - 0.5876\n978\t      - 0.5873\n979\t      - +0.06pp\n980\t      - 0.42 (n.s.)\n981\t    - - 30%\n982\t      - 0.5912\n983\t      - 0.5897\n984\t      - 0.5858\n985\t      - +0.54pp\n986\t      - 0.08 (marginal)\n987\t    - - 50%\n988\t      - 0.5941\n989\t      - 0.5892\n990\t      - 0.5865\n991\t      - +0.76pp\n992\t      - 0.003 **\n993\t  figures_description:\n994\t  - 'Dose vs MMLU line plot: three strategies (binary, graduated, no-filter) showing\n995\t    divergence with increasing dose'\n996\t  - 'Binary-vs-graduated delta vs dose: monotonically increasing gap, annotated with\n997\t    p-values'\n998\t  analysis: 'Dose-response 是 C3 claim 的重要补充。Key message: K*-aware binary filtering\n999\t    的优势 不是 dose-specific artifact——它在所有测试 dose 下都是最优策略（虽然在低 dose 下差异 不显著）。Graduated\n1000\t    filtering 的 failure 同样 dose-invariant，验证了 K*=2 作为 universal curation guideline\n1001\t    的 actionability。Limitation: 仅测了 3 个 dose 点， 连续 dose-response curve 留作 future work。论文定位：exp-006\n1002\t    (50% dose) 的 补充 ablation，放在 Appendix 或 §4.3 的 subsection。\n1003\t\n1004\t    '\n1005\t- name: Naturalistic Common Crawl validation\n1006\t  plan_id: exp-014\n1007\t  description: '对 Common Crawl 2025/2026 snapshot 样本做 depth prediction，与 AlignScore\n1008\t    和 vocabulary richness 指标做 correlation analysis。\n1009\t\n1010\t    '\n1011\t  expected_results:\n1012\t    n_documents: 50000\n1013\t    predicted_depth_distribution:\n1014\t      cc_2025:\n1015\t        depth_0: 0.72\n1016\t        depth_1: 0.18\n1017\t        depth_2: 0.07\n1018\t        depth_3+: 0.03\n1019\t      cc_2026:\n1020\t        depth_0: 0.65\n1021\t        depth_1: 0.22\n1022\t        depth_2: 0.09\n1023\t        depth_3+: 0.04\n1024\t    correlation_with_alignscore:\n1025\t      spearman_rho: 0.418\n1026\t      p_value: <0.001\n1027\t      interpretation: 'moderate positive: higher predicted depth ↔ lower text quality'\n1028\t    correlation_with_vocab_richness:\n1029\t      ttr_spearman: -0.372\n1030\t      hapax_spearman: -0.341\n1031\t      freq_entropy_spearman: -0.389\n1032\t    temporal_shift:\n1033\t      mean_predicted_depth_2025: 0.42\n1034\t      mean_predicted_depth_2026: 0.51\n1035\t      shift_p_value: <0.001\n1036\t  result_rationale: 'Naturalistic validation 是 median 档最不确定的实验。AlignScore correlation\n1037\t    ρ=0.42 是 moderate 而非 strong，原因：(1) Common Crawl 包含大量非递归合成文本（SEO spam, template\n1038\t    text, translation artifacts）会被误判为有 depth 信号；(2) AlignScore 主要衡量 factual consistency\n1039\t    而非 distributional degradation，两者 correlated 但不 identical；(3) 没有 ground truth depth\n1040\t    labels，所有分析都是 correlational。Vocabulary richness 指标与 predicted depth 的负相关（ρ=-0.34\n1041\t    到 -0.39）符合 degradation ordering 预期：更深代次 的文本 vocabulary diversity 更低。2025→2026\n1042\t    的 predicted depth 增加（mean 0.42→0.51） 与公开报告的合成文本增长趋势一致，但 confounded by CC 爬取策略变化。\n1043\t\n1044\t    '\n1045\t  tables:\n1046\t  - title: 'Table: Predicted depth distribution in Common Crawl snapshots'\n1047\t    columns:\n1048\t    - snapshot\n1049\t    - depth 0\n1050\t    - depth 1\n1051\t    - depth 2\n1052\t    - depth 3+\n1053\t    - mean_depth\n1054\t    rows:\n1055\t    - - CC 2025-Q1\n1056\t      - 72%\n1057\t      - 18%\n1058\t      - 7%\n1059\t      - 3%\n1060\t      - 0.42\n1061\t    - - CC 2026-Q1\n1062\t      - 65%\n1063\t      - 22%\n1064\t      - 9%\n1065\t      - 4%\n1066\t      - 0.51\n1067\t  - title: 'Table: Correlation with text quality indicators'\n1068\t    columns:\n1069\t    - indicator\n1070\t    - spearman_ρ\n1071\t    - p_value\n1072\t    - direction\n1073\t    rows:\n1074\t    - - AlignScore\n1075\t      - 0.418\n1076\t      - <0.001\n1077\t      - higher depth → lower quality\n1078\t    - - TTR\n1079\t      - -0.372\n1080\t      - <0.001\n1081\t      - higher depth → lower diversity\n1082\t    - - Hapax ratio\n1083\t      - -0.341\n1084\t      - <0.001\n1085\t      - higher depth → fewer rare words\n1086\t    - - Freq entropy\n1087\t      - -0.389\n1088\t      - <0.001\n1089\t      - higher depth → lower entropy\n1090\t  figures_description:\n1091\t  - 'Predicted depth histogram: 2025 vs 2026 side-by-side showing rightward shift'\n1092\t  - 'Scatter plots: predicted depth vs AlignScore / TTR / freq_entropy with regression\n1093\t    lines'\n1094\t  analysis: 'Naturalistic validation 提供 suggestive 而非 conclusive evidence。论文措辞谨慎：\n1095\t    \"Predicted depth distributions are consistent with reported trends in synthetic\n1096\t    content prevalence\" + \"moderate correlation with independent quality measures\n1097\t    provides convergent validity for the OBD framework\"。明确 limitation：no ground truth,\n1098\t    correlational only, confounded by non-recursive synthetic text。 论文定位：§5 Discussion\n1099\t    的一个 subsection 或 Appendix。\n1100\t\n1101\t    '\n1102\t- name: Wikipedia domain ablation\n1103\t  plan_id: exp-023\n1104\t  description: 'Wikipedia seed data, Qwen2.5-1.5B base continuation, 验证 K*=2 是否跨数据域一致。\n1105\t    Status: orphaned（可能因优先级调整被搁置）。\n1106\t\n1107\t    '\n1108\t  expected_results:\n1109\t    k_star: 2\n1110\t    pairwise_auc:\n1111\t      0v1: 0.9912\n1112\t      1v2: 0.6183\n1113\t      2v3: 0.5518\n1114\t      3v4: 0.5247\n1115\t      4v5: 0.5112\n1116\t    bootstrap_ci:\n1117\t      0v1:\n1118\t        auc: 0.9912\n1119\t        ci_lower: 0.9895\n1120\t        ci_upper: 0.9929\n1121\t        perm_p: 0.0001\n1122\t      1v2:\n1123\t        auc: 0.6183\n1124\t        ci_lower: 0.6074\n1125\t        ci_upper: 0.6292\n1126\t        perm_p: 0.0001\n1127\t      2v3:\n1128\t        auc: 0.5518\n1129\t        ci_lower: 0.5415\n1130\t        ci_upper: 0.5621\n1131\t        perm_p: 0.0001\n1132\t      3v4:\n1133\t        auc: 0.5247\n1134\t        ci_lower: 0.5142\n1135\t        ci_upper: 0.5352\n1136\t        perm_p: 0.0003\n1137\t      4v5:\n1138\t        auc: 0.5112\n1139\t        ci_lower: 0.5007\n1140\t        ci_upper: 0.5217\n1141\t        perm_p: 0.0312\n1142\t    c4_vs_wiki_comparison:\n1143\t      c4_1v2: 0.6262\n1144\t      wiki_1v2: 0.6183\n1145\t      delta: -0.0079\n1146\t      feature_ranking_rho: 0.878\n1147\t    ordinal_mae: 1.178\n1148\t    ordinal_accuracy: 0.369\n1149\t    top_features:\n1150\t    - surp_std\n1151\t    - freq_entropy\n1152\t    - surp_d1_std\n1153\t    - surp_d1_skew\n1154\t    - surp_mean\n1155\t  result_rationale: 'Wikipedia K*=2 与 C4 一致但 1v2 AUC 低 0.8pp（0.618 vs 0.626）。差异的来源：\n1156\t    Wikipedia 文本有更强的 structural formatting（section headers, lists, citations,  infobox-derived\n1157\t    text），这些 domain-specific patterns 在 continuation mode 下被 model 部分保留，减少了 generation-specific\n1158\t    degradation signal。freq_entropy 在 Wikipedia 上的 discriminative power 略低，因为 Wikipedia\n1159\t    的 vocabulary distribution 本身更集中 （专业术语 + 百科体裁的 formulaic expressions）。Feature ranking\n1160\t    ρ=0.878 vs C4 说明 degradation mechanism 跨域一致但 feature importance 的具体排列有 domain-specific\n1161\t    shift。 整体结论：K*=2 是 domain-independent，支持 universality claim 的 scope 扩展。\n1162\t\n1163\t    '\n1164\t  tables:\n1165\t  - title: 'Table: C4 vs Wikipedia domain comparison (Qwen-base)'\n1166\t    columns:\n1167\t    - domain\n1168\t    - 0v1\n1169\t    - 1v2\n1170\t    - 1v2 CI lower\n1171\t    - 2v3\n1172\t    - k_star\n1173\t    rows:\n1174\t    - - C4\n1175\t      - 0.987\n1176\t      - 0.6262\n1177\t      - 0.6168\n1178\t      - 0.5496\n1179\t      - 2\n1180\t    - - Wikipedia\n1181\t      - 0.9912\n1182\t      - 0.6183\n1183\t      - 0.6074\n1184\t      - 0.5518\n1185\t      - 2\n1186\t  figures_description:\n1187\t  - 'AUC decay curves: C4 vs Wikipedia overlay showing near-identical profiles'\n1188\t  - 'Feature importance comparison: highlighting freq_entropy''s domain-specific rank\n1189\t    shift'\n1190\t  analysis: 'Domain ablation 是 universality claim 的 low-hanging fruit supplement。K*=2\n1191\t    holds， feature ranking 高度一致（ρ=0.878），domain 对 K* 没有影响。但 orphaned status 意味着 这个实验可能不会在\n1192\t    EMNLP submission 前完成——如果时间不够，可以将其定位为 \"future work: systematic domain ablation\n1193\t    across web, academic, and code domains\"。如果完成， 放入 Appendix 作为 universality 的额外\n1194\t    data point。\n1195\t\n1196\t    '\n1197\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c34e77cc-1c13-4804-a3da-cf0cd53aac24","uuid":"c0501416-2be5-4b45-b092-6e17633921ed","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:19:57.989Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_7/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T073047/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Universality claim scoped 为 ''K*=2 is consistent across all tested\n  conditions meeting minimum information requirements (≥256 tokens; standard decoding)''。Mistral\n  的失败被分析为 architecture-specific information compression rate 导致的 principled boundary\n  case（SWA/GQA 架构 在 cross-scorer 条件下 15D features 信号不足），128-token 的失败用 DPI 的 minimum\n  mutual information threshold 解释。Pythia T=0.7 的边缘性用 low-temperature channel narrowing\n  解释——temperature 过低导致 vocabulary distribution 预先收窄，减少了 generational degradation 的可测量空间。增加\n  §5.x ''Boundary conditions of universality'' 段落，将三类失败条件（短文本/低温/跨架构 scorer mismatch）统一在\n  DPI framework 下。C1'' 措辞降为 ''K*=2 is a robust discrimination boundary under standard\n  conditions (≥256 tokens, T≥0.9, compatible scorer architecture)''。仍冲 EMNLP Main——14/19\n  primary conditions K*=2 的一致性足够强，且失败条件均有理论预测支撑。Rebuttal 策略：承认 scope + 强调已覆盖条件的 100%\n  一致性 + DPI 预测三类 boundary 的准确性作为理论泛化的证据。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: LLaMA-3.1-8B cross-family depth chain\n  plan_id: exp-018\n  description: 'LLaMA-3.1-8B continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs,\n    depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B。新模型族中表现较好的一个。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 2\n    pairwise_auc:\n      0v1: 0.9718\n      1v2: 0.6253\n      2v3: 0.5548\n      3v4: 0.5212\n      4v5: 0.5083\n    pairwise_auc_std:\n      0v1: 0.0028\n      1v2: 0.0092\n      2v3: 0.0058\n      3v4: 0.0095\n      4v5: 0.0071\n    bootstrap_ci:\n      0v1:\n        auc: 0.9718\n        ci_lower: 0.9693\n        ci_upper: 0.9743\n        perm_p: 0.0001\n      1v2:\n        auc: 0.6253\n        ci_lower: 0.6072\n        ci_upper: 0.6434\n        perm_p: 0.0001\n      2v3:\n        auc: 0.5548\n        ci_lower: 0.5447\n        ci_upper: 0.5649\n        perm_p: 0.0001\n      3v4:\n        auc: 0.5212\n        ci_lower: 0.5108\n        ci_upper: 0.5316\n        perm_p: 0.0012\n      4v5:\n        auc: 0.5083\n        ci_lower: 0.4978\n        ci_upper: 0.5188\n        perm_p: 0.0892\n    pairwise_jsd:\n      0v1: 0.1384\n      1v2: 0.0108\n      2v3: 0.0049\n      3v4: 0.0038\n      4v5: 0.0031\n    ordinal_mae: 1.198\n    ordinal_accuracy: 0.357\n    top_features:\n    - freq_entropy\n    - surp_d1_mean\n    - surp_std\n    - surp_d1_skew\n    - hapax_ratio\n  result_rationale: 'LLaMA-3.1-8B 使用 GQA + RoPE 的标准 Transformer 架构，与 Qwen-7B（exp-004）同为\n    7-8B continuation mode + cross-scorer 条件。Qwen-7B 1v2=0.6178（CI lower 0.6079），LLaMA-8B\n    预期略高于 Qwen-7B（0.625 vs 0.618）因为 LLaMA 的训练数据更侧重英文 web text 与 C4 分布更匹配， 生成文本的统计特征与\n    Qwen scorer 的 surprisal 计算有更好的 calibration。但 CI lower 仅 0.607， 比 θ=0.60 高 0.7pp——边缘但\n    robust。0v1 AUC 0.972 低于 ≤1.5B 模型的 0.99+ 是因为 8B 模型 生成文本质量更高，human-gen0 到 gen1 的跨越更小。4v5\n    non-significant（p=0.089）与 Qwen-7B 的 4v5 p=0.0676 pattern 一致——大模型的深层代际几乎不可区分。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: LLaMA-3.1-8B pairwise depth discrimination'\n    columns:\n    - depth_pair\n    - auc\n    - ci_95\n    - perm_p\n    - k_star_boundary\n    rows:\n    - - 0v1\n      - 0.9718\n      - '[0.9693, 0.9743]'\n      - <0.001\n      - '-'\n    - - 1v2\n      - 0.6253\n      - '[0.6072, 0.6434]'\n      - <0.001\n      - K*=2 ✅ (CI lower 0.607>0.60)\n    - - 2v3\n      - 0.5548\n      - '[0.5447, 0.5649]'\n      - <0.001\n      - below θ\n    - - 3v4\n      - 0.5212\n      - '[0.5108, 0.5316]'\n      - '0.001'\n      - '-'\n    - - 4v5\n      - 0.5083\n      - '[0.4978, 0.5188]'\n      - '0.089'\n      - n.s.\n  figures_description:\n  - 'AUC decay curve: 与 Qwen-7B (exp-004) overlay，showing similar decay profile but\n    LLaMA consistently ~0.7pp higher at 1v2'\n  - 'Feature importance bar chart: top-5 features 与 Qwen-7B 共享 4/5（freq_entropy, surp_d1_mean,\n    surp_std, surp_d1_skew），hapax_ratio 替代 surp_mean 进入 top-5'\n  analysis: 'LLaMA-8B 确认 K*=2 在第二个大规模模型族（非 Qwen 系列）上成立。CI lower=0.607 高于 θ 但属 median\n    档预期的边缘范围（0.600-0.607）。与 Qwen-7B 的 CI lower=0.608 高度一致，说明 7-8B 规模 + cross-scorer\n    条件下的 1v2 边界是 systematic 而非 random。Top features 中 hapax_ratio 进入 top-5 是 LLaMA\n    特有——LLaMA 的 BPE 词表与 Qwen 不同，rare token 分布 在 generational degradation 下的变化模式略有差异。但\n    surp_d1_std/surp_std/surp_d2_std 仍在 top-10 内，与 exp-005 的 shared_top_discriminators\n    一致。Paper 可将 LLaMA-8B 作为 universality evidence 的第 6 个独立模型族。\n\n    '\n- name: Mistral-7B-v0.3 cross-family depth chain\n  plan_id: exp-019\n  description: 'Mistral-7B-v0.3 continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs,\n    depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B。新模型族中表现较差的一个，K* 降至 1。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 1\n    pairwise_auc:\n      0v1: 0.9681\n      1v2: 0.5934\n      2v3: 0.5487\n      3v4: 0.5195\n      4v5: 0.5068\n    pairwise_auc_std:\n      0v1: 0.0031\n      1v2: 0.0098\n      2v3: 0.0062\n      3v4: 0.0088\n      4v5: 0.0075\n    bootstrap_ci:\n      0v1:\n        auc: 0.9681\n        ci_lower: 0.9652\n        ci_upper: 0.971\n        perm_p: 0.0001\n      1v2:\n        auc: 0.5934\n        ci_lower: 0.5821\n        ci_upper: 0.6047\n        perm_p: 0.0001\n      2v3:\n        auc: 0.5487\n        ci_lower: 0.5382\n        ci_upper: 0.5592\n        perm_p: 0.0001\n      3v4:\n        auc: 0.5195\n        ci_lower: 0.5092\n        ci_upper: 0.5298\n        perm_p: 0.0034\n      4v5:\n        auc: 0.5068\n        ci_lower: 0.4963\n        ci_upper: 0.5173\n        perm_p: 0.134\n    pairwise_jsd:\n      0v1: 0.1312\n      1v2: 0.0079\n      2v3: 0.0044\n      3v4: 0.0035\n      4v5: 0.0028\n    ordinal_mae: 1.241\n    ordinal_accuracy: 0.342\n    top_features:\n    - surp_d1_mean\n    - freq_entropy\n    - surp_std\n    - surp_mean\n    - surp_d1_skew\n  result_rationale: 'Mistral-7B-v0.3 是 median 档的核心 boundary case。1v2 AUC=0.593，CI\n    lower=0.582， CI upper=0.605——CI 上界刚好跨过 θ=0.60 但下界远低于阈值。K*=1 的根因分析：(1) Mistral\n    的 GQA(8 heads) + 大 vocabulary (32K) 组合意味着每个 generation step 的 information loss\n    rate 低于 Pythia/OLMo——Mistral 是一个更\"高保真\"的 iterated channel，DPI 预测 K*_theory 更高但\n    K*_empirical 被 15D features 的检测灵敏度 cap 住；(2) cross-scorer 条件（Qwen-1.5B 计算 surprisal）引入\n    tokenizer/architecture mismatch——Mistral 使用 SentencePiece BPE 而 Qwen 使用 不同的 BPE\n    scheme，相同文本的 token boundary 不同导致 surprisal-derived features 精度降低； (3) JSD 1v2=0.0079\n    是所有模型中最低的（Pythia 0.014, OLMo 0.013, Qwen-cont 0.005 但 Qwen-cont 是 self-scorer），说明\n    gen1→gen2 的分布变化确实很小。论文定位：Mistral 不是 counterexample 而是 principled boundary——它验证了\n    DPI 框架的预测，即高容量低损耗模型的 K*_empirical 受限于 feature 灵敏度而非信号不存在。exp-015 的 neural probe\n    结果（neural representations 比 15D 多辨别 1 个深度）暗示如果用 Mistral 自身 embeddings 做 probe\n    可能恢复 K*=2。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Mistral-7B pairwise depth discrimination'\n    columns:\n    - depth_pair\n    - auc\n    - ci_95\n    - perm_p\n    - k_star_boundary\n    rows:\n    - - 0v1\n      - 0.9681\n      - '[0.9652, 0.9710]'\n      - <0.001\n      - '-'\n    - - 1v2\n      - 0.5934\n      - '[0.5821, 0.6047]'\n      - <0.001\n      - K*=1 ❌ (CI lower 0.582<0.60)\n    - - 2v3\n      - 0.5487\n      - '[0.5382, 0.5592]'\n      - <0.001\n      - below θ\n    - - 3v4\n      - 0.5195\n      - '[0.5092, 0.5298]'\n      - '0.003'\n      - '-'\n    - - 4v5\n      - 0.5068\n      - '[0.4963, 0.5173]'\n      - '0.134'\n      - n.s.\n  - title: 'Table: New model family comparison'\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - 1v2_auc\n    - ci_lower\n    - k_star\n    - scorer\n    rows:\n    - - LLaMA-3.1-8B\n      - 0.6253\n      - 0.6072\n      - 2\n      - Qwen-1.5B\n    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n      - 0.5934\n      - 0.5821\n      - 1\n      - Qwen-1.5B\n    - - Qwen2.5-7B (exp-004)\n      - 0.6178\n      - 0.6079\n      - 2\n      - Qwen-1.5B\n    - - Qwen2.5-1.5B base (exp-016)\n      - 0.6262\n      - 0.6168\n      - 2\n      - self\n  figures_description:\n  - 'AUC decay comparison across all 7-8B models: LLaMA, Mistral, Qwen-7B overlay\n    showing Mistral''s flatter decay curve (lower information loss rate)'\n  - 'JSD heatmap: Mistral''s 1v2 JSD visibly lowest among all models, linking to DPI\n    channel capacity interpretation'\n  analysis: 'Mistral K*=1 是 median 档的 defining result。论文处理策略：(1) 在 §4.1 universality\n    结果表中 标注 Mistral 为 boundary case（CI upper 0.605 跨 θ）；(2) 在 §5.x Boundary Conditions\n    段落中分析三个 contributing factors（low info loss rate, cross-scorer tokenizer mismatch,\n    feature sensitivity ceiling）；(3) 引用 DPI 理论论证 K*_theory ≥ 2 但 K*_empirical 受限于\n    measurement precision——类比物理实验中测量精度与真实值的关系；(4) 与 exp-015 neural probe 结果对照，论证更精细的\n    representation 可能恢复更高 K*。关键 rebuttal 准备：如果 reviewer 说 \"Mistral 证伪了 universality\"，回应\n    1v2 AUC=0.593 仍远高于 chance (0.50)，信号存在但 被 θ=0.60 阈值 cut off——这是 operational threshold\n    choice 而非 physical boundary。\n\n    '\n- name: Pythia-1.4B decoding strategy ablation\n  plan_id: exp-020\n  description: 'Pythia-1.4B 上复现 exp-003 的解码策略实验（greedy / nucleus p=0.9 / T=0.7 / T=1.2），\n    验证解码不变性是否跨模型成立。3/4 配置确认 K*=2，T=0.7 边缘。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    config1_greedy:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9748\n        1v2: 0.6482\n        2v3: 0.5504\n        3v4: 0.5163\n        4v5: 0.5098\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        1v2:\n          auc: 0.6482\n          ci_lower: 0.6378\n          ci_upper: 0.6586\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        2v3:\n          auc: 0.5504\n          ci_lower: 0.5401\n          ci_upper: 0.5607\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n    config2_nuc09:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9911\n        1v2: 0.6397\n        2v3: 0.5468\n        3v4: 0.5138\n        4v5: 0.5072\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        1v2:\n          auc: 0.6397\n          ci_lower: 0.6271\n          ci_upper: 0.6523\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        2v3:\n          auc: 0.5468\n          ci_lower: 0.5363\n          ci_upper: 0.5573\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n    config3_t07:\n      k_star: 1\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9812\n        1v2: 0.6118\n        2v3: 0.5472\n        3v4: 0.5186\n        4v5: 0.5114\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        1v2:\n          auc: 0.6118\n          ci_lower: 0.5973\n          ci_upper: 0.6263\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        2v3:\n          auc: 0.5472\n          ci_lower: 0.5368\n          ci_upper: 0.5576\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n    config4_t12:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9967\n        1v2: 0.6648\n        2v3: 0.5537\n        3v4: 0.5171\n        4v5: 0.5126\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        1v2:\n          auc: 0.6648\n          ci_lower: 0.6542\n          ci_upper: 0.6754\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        2v3:\n          auc: 0.5537\n          ci_lower: 0.5432\n          ci_upper: 0.5642\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n    kstar2_fraction: 0.75\n    summary:\n      all_0v1_above_097: true\n      all_2v3_below_060: true\n      t07_ci_lower: 0.5973\n      t07_marginal_note: CI lower 0.597 < θ=0.60 by 0.3pp\n  result_rationale: 'Pythia-1.4B 的 baseline 1v2 AUC=0.6539（nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0），比\n    Qwen 的 baseline 低约 4-8pp（Qwen-rw 0.696, Qwen-cont 0.611）。在 Qwen 上 4/4 decoding\n    configs 均 K*=2 是因为 Qwen 的 1v2 signal 有足够 headroom（最低 0.686）。Pythia 的 headroom\n    更小。 T=0.7 成为 edge case 的机制：低温使 Pythia 的 token selection 更集中在高概率区域，每代 生成文本的 vocabulary\n    distribution 已经被 temperature 预先收窄（entropy reduction）， 留给 generational degradation\n    的可测量空间减少。具体来说，T=0.7 下 freq_entropy 和 hapax_ratio 的 baseline variance 更低，surp_std\n    的 depth-wise gradient 变平——这些 恰好是 1v2 discrimination 的关键 features。CI lower=0.597\n    仅低于 θ 0.3pp，属于 measurement noise 边界。T=1.2 给出最高 1v2（0.665）因为高温放大了 generation noise，\n    加速信息损失→1v2 contrast 增强。Greedy（0.648）高于 nucleus p=0.9（0.640）因为 greedy 的完全确定性使得\n    generational drift 在 repetition/diversity features 上 更容易被捕捉。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Pythia decoding ablation pairwise AUC'\n    columns:\n    - config\n    - 0v1\n    - 1v2\n    - 1v2 CI\n    - 2v3\n    - k_star\n    rows:\n    - - greedy\n      - 0.9748\n      - 0.6482\n      - '[0.638, 0.659]'\n      - 0.5504\n      - 2 ✅\n    - - nuc p=0.9\n      - 0.9911\n      - 0.6397\n      - '[0.627, 0.652]'\n      - 0.5468\n      - 2 ✅\n    - - T=0.7\n      - 0.9812\n      - 0.6118\n      - '[0.597, 0.626]'\n      - 0.5472\n      - 1 ⚠️\n    - - T=1.2\n      - 0.9967\n      - 0.6648\n      - '[0.654, 0.675]'\n      - 0.5537\n      - 2 ✅\n  - title: 'Table: Qwen (exp-003) vs Pythia (exp-020) decoding comparison'\n    columns:\n    - config\n    - qwen_1v2\n    - pythia_1v2\n    - delta\n    - both_kstar2\n    rows:\n    - - greedy\n      - 0.6892\n      - 0.6482\n      - -4.1pp\n      - ✅\n    - - nuc p=0.9\n      - 0.6862\n      - 0.6397\n      - -4.7pp\n      - ✅\n    - - T=0.7\n      - 0.6885\n      - 0.6118\n      - -7.7pp\n      - ❌ (Pythia fails)\n    - - T=1.2\n      - 0.7037\n      - 0.6648\n      - -3.9pp\n      - ✅\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Side-by-side AUC decay curves: Qwen (exp-003) vs Pythia (exp-020) for each decoding\n    config, highlighting T=0.7 divergence'\n  - 'Temperature vs 1v2 AUC scatter: both models show positive correlation, Pythia\n    curve shifted ~4-5pp lower'\n  analysis: '3/4 K*=2 的结果使 decoding invariance claim 从 \"absolute\" 降级为 \"robust under\n    standard conditions\"。T=0.7 的失败是 model-specific：Qwen T=0.7 的 1v2=0.689 远高于阈值（CI\n    lower 0.680），但 Pythia T=0.7 仅 0.612（CI lower 0.597）。Qwen→Pythia 的 delta 在 T=0.7\n    时最大（-7.7pp vs 其他 config 的 -3.9 到 -4.7pp），说明 Pythia 对低温更敏感——可能因为 Pythia 的 vocabulary\n    size 更小（50K vs Qwen 的 151K），低温下的 effective vocabulary 收窄更剧烈。论文处理：在 §4.x Decoding\n    段落中报告 7/8 跨模型×decoding configs K*=2， T=0.7 × Pythia 作为 boundary case 放入 §5.x。措辞\n    \"K*=2 is invariant to decoding strategy for T≥0.9; at T=0.7, model-dependent sensitivity\n    emerges\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Text length ablation (128/256/512 tokens)\n  plan_id: exp-021\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct continuation, 三个文本长度（128/256/512 tokens），验证\n    K* 的 minimum information requirement。128-token 预期 K*=1。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    length_128:\n      k_star: 1\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9893\n        1v2: 0.5902\n        2v3: 0.5481\n        3v4: 0.5327\n        4v5: 0.5189\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1:\n          auc: 0.9893\n          ci_lower: 0.9872\n          ci_upper: 0.9914\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        1v2:\n          auc: 0.5902\n          ci_lower: 0.5762\n          ci_upper: 0.6042\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        2v3:\n          auc: 0.5481\n          ci_lower: 0.5342\n          ci_upper: 0.562\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        3v4:\n          auc: 0.5327\n          ci_lower: 0.5188\n          ci_upper: 0.5466\n          perm_p: 0.0008\n        4v5:\n          auc: 0.5189\n          ci_lower: 0.505\n          ci_upper: 0.5328\n          perm_p: 0.0243\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.2614\n        1v2: 0.0038\n        2v3: 0.0029\n        3v4: 0.0024\n        4v5: 0.0021\n      ordinal_mae: 1.223\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.361\n    length_256:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9948\n        1v2: 0.6187\n        2v3: 0.5572\n        3v4: 0.5378\n        4v5: 0.5148\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1:\n          auc: 0.9948\n          ci_lower: 0.9937\n          ci_upper: 0.9959\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        1v2:\n          auc: 0.6187\n          ci_lower: 0.6078\n          ci_upper: 0.6296\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        2v3:\n          auc: 0.5572\n          ci_lower: 0.5467\n          ci_upper: 0.5677\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        3v4:\n          auc: 0.5378\n          ci_lower: 0.5273\n          ci_upper: 0.5483\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        4v5:\n          auc: 0.5148\n          ci_lower: 0.5043\n          ci_upper: 0.5253\n          perm_p: 0.0052\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.2748\n        1v2: 0.0046\n        2v3: 0.0033\n        3v4: 0.003\n        4v5: 0.0027\n      ordinal_mae: 1.172\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.375\n    length_512:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9971\n        1v2: 0.6341\n        2v3: 0.5632\n        3v4: 0.5413\n        4v5: 0.5156\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1:\n          auc: 0.9971\n          ci_lower: 0.9963\n          ci_upper: 0.9979\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        1v2:\n          auc: 0.6341\n          ci_lower: 0.6228\n          ci_upper: 0.6454\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        2v3:\n          auc: 0.5632\n          ci_lower: 0.5529\n          ci_upper: 0.5735\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        3v4:\n          auc: 0.5413\n          ci_lower: 0.531\n          ci_upper: 0.5516\n          perm_p: 0.0001\n        4v5:\n          auc: 0.5156\n          ci_lower: 0.5051\n          ci_upper: 0.5261\n          perm_p: 0.0041\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.2871\n        1v2: 0.0052\n        2v3: 0.0036\n        3v4: 0.0032\n        4v5: 0.0029\n      ordinal_mae: 1.148\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.384\n    length_effect_summary:\n      auc_1v2_by_length:\n        128: 0.5902\n        256: 0.6187\n        512: 0.6341\n      kstar_by_length:\n        128: 1\n        256: 2\n        512: 2\n      minimum_length_for_kstar2: 256\n  result_rationale: '128-token K*=1 的根因是统计估计器的 sample size 效应，而非 depth signal 不存在。15D\n    features 中的 distributional statistics（freq_entropy 基于 unigram 频率分布，hapax_ratio\n    基于 unique token 比例，surp_std/surp_skew 基于 surprisal 分布的高阶矩）在 128 tokens 下 有极高的\n    estimation variance。以 hapax_ratio 为例：128 tokens 中 ~80-100 unique tokens， hapax\n    数量的 Poisson 噪声使得 depth 0 和 depth 1 的 hapax_ratio 分布严重重叠。 surp_std 的 standard error\n    在 n=128 时约为 σ/√(128) ≈ σ/11.3，而 n=512 时约为 σ/22.6， precision 差 2 倍。JSD 1v2 从 512（0.0052）到\n    128（0.0038）的下降（-27%）直接反映了 这个 estimation noise 效应。1v2 AUC=0.5902 的 CI upper=0.6042\n    刚过 θ=0.60，说明 信号存在但 buried in noise。256 tokens 是 minimum viable length（CI lower=0.608\n    > 0.60 且 margin 合理）。512→默认长度（exp-017 使用的长度）时 AUC 进一步提升至 0.634，但 256→512 的增量（+1.5pp）远小于\n    128→256 的增量（+2.9pp），说明 256 已捕获主要 statistical precision gains。DPI interpretation：每个\n    generation step 的 mutual information loss 是 per-token 的常数 ε，但 15D features 只能在\n    aggregate statistics 上测量——aggregate 的 precision 需要 sufficient sample size，128\n    tokens 低于这个 threshold。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Length ablation summary'\n    columns:\n    - length\n    - 1v2_auc\n    - 1v2 CI\n    - 1v2_jsd\n    - k_star\n    - feature CI width (mean)\n    rows:\n    - - 128\n      - 0.5902\n      - '[0.576, 0.604]'\n      - 0.0038\n      - 1 ❌\n      - ±0.014\n    - - 256\n      - 0.6187\n      - '[0.608, 0.630]'\n      - 0.0046\n      - 2 ✅\n      - ±0.011\n    - - 512\n      - 0.6341\n      - '[0.623, 0.645]'\n      - 0.0052\n      - 2 ✅\n      - ±0.008\n  - title: 'Table: Per-feature AUC at 1v2 by length'\n    columns:\n    - feature\n    - auc_128\n    - auc_256\n    - auc_512\n    rows:\n    - - freq_entropy\n      - 0.554\n      - 0.571\n      - 0.582\n    - - surp_std\n      - 0.548\n      - 0.565\n      - 0.578\n    - - surp_d1_std\n      - 0.542\n      - 0.558\n      - 0.573\n    - - hapax_ratio\n      - 0.536\n      - 0.555\n      - 0.569\n    - - ttr\n      - 0.533\n      - 0.551\n      - 0.566\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Length vs 1v2 AUC curve with CI bands: showing monotonic increase with diminishing\n    returns, vertical line at 256 marking ''minimum viable length'''\n  - 'Feature-level AUC heatmap (length × feature × depth pair): 128-token row visibly\n    noisier with wider CI bands'\n  - 'Bootstrap CI width vs length: demonstrating √n scaling of precision'\n  analysis: 'Length ablation 的关键贡献：(1) 建立 K* 的 minimum information requirement（≥256\n    tokens）， 将 universality claim 的 scope 精确化；(2) 提供 DPI framework 的 quantitative\n    validation ——如果 per-token information loss 是常数 ε，则 aggregate MI scales with n，预测\n    longer text → higher K*_empirical（or at least more precise measurement），实验数据完美符合；\n    (3) 为 practitioner 提供 actionable guidance——对 128 tokens 以下的短文本不应尝试 depth estimation。128-token\n    的 CI upper=0.604 跨过 θ 但 lower=0.576 远低于——如果 θ 设为 0.575 则 128 tokens 也 \"pass\"，但这样会让其他多个条件变得不可靠。这进一步证明\n    θ=0.60 是 well-calibrated 的 operational threshold。\n\n    '\n- name: 4×4 cross-scorer matrix\n  plan_id: exp-022\n  description: '4 generators × 4 scorers 完整交叉验证，量化 scorer independence。重现 exp_A 中的\n    scorer-dependence 模式但在更大矩阵上验证其可控性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    generators:\n    - Qwen-1.5B-cont\n    - Pythia-1.4B\n    - OLMo-1B\n    - Qwen2.5-7B\n    scorers:\n    - Qwen-1.5B\n    - Pythia-1.4B\n    - OLMo-1B\n    - Qwen2.5-7B\n    kstar_matrix:\n      Qwen1.5_Qwen1.5: 2\n      Qwen1.5_Pythia: 1\n      Qwen1.5_OLMo: 1\n      Qwen1.5_Qwen7B: 2\n      Pythia_Qwen1.5: 2\n      Pythia_Pythia: 2\n      Pythia_OLMo: 2\n      Pythia_Qwen7B: 2\n      OLMo_Qwen1.5: 2\n      OLMo_Pythia: 2\n      OLMo_OLMo: 2\n      OLMo_Qwen7B: 2\n      Qwen7B_Qwen1.5: 2\n      Qwen7B_Pythia: 1\n      Qwen7B_OLMo: 1\n      Qwen7B_Qwen7B: 2\n    kstar2_count: 12\n    kstar2_fraction: 0.75\n    auc_1v2_matrix:\n      Qwen1.5_Qwen1.5: 0.6114\n      Qwen1.5_Pythia: 0.5887\n      Qwen1.5_OLMo: 0.5843\n      Qwen1.5_Qwen7B: 0.6078\n      Pythia_Qwen1.5: 0.6412\n      Pythia_Pythia: 0.6539\n      Pythia_OLMo: 0.6361\n      Pythia_Qwen7B: 0.6387\n      OLMo_Qwen1.5: 0.6058\n      OLMo_Pythia: 0.6127\n      OLMo_OLMo: 0.6146\n      OLMo_Qwen7B: 0.6093\n      Qwen7B_Qwen1.5: 0.6178\n      Qwen7B_Pythia: 0.5932\n      Qwen7B_OLMo: 0.5891\n      Qwen7B_Qwen7B: 0.6248\n    self_scorer_avg_1v2: 0.6262\n    cross_scorer_avg_1v2: 0.6095\n    cross_scorer_delta: -0.0167\n    feature_ranking_spearman_across_scorers:\n      mean_rho: 0.912\n      min_rho: 0.873\n      max_rho: 0.958\n  result_rationale: 'Cross-scorer matrix 重现 exp_A 的核心 pattern：K* 主要由 generator 决定而非\n    scorer， 但 generator-scorer 之间的 architectural distance 调制 signal strength。12/16\n    K*=2 （0.75）在 median 指标范围 [0.6, 0.85] 内。4 个 K*=1 failure 的结构化分析： (1) Qwen-1.5B-cont\n    作为 generator 被 Pythia/OLMo scored 时 K*=1——Qwen-cont 的 1v2 signal 本身最弱（self-scored\n    仅 0.611，CI lower 0.6015），cross-scorer 增加的 noise（~-2pp）足以将其推到 θ 以下；(2) Qwen-7B\n    被 Pythia/OLMo scored 时 K*=1—— 同理，7B 模型的 self-scored 1v2=0.618 已在边缘，加上 7B→1.4B/1B\n    scorer 的 scale mismatch（smaller scorer 的 surprisal resolution 不足以捕捉 7B 模型的精细 depth\n    signal）。注意 Pythia 和 OLMo 作为 generator 时完全 robust（4/4 scorers 都 K*=2）， 因为它们的 self-scored\n    1v2 较高（0.654 和 0.615）且与其他模型的 architectural distance 较小。Feature ranking ρ≥0.87\n    跨所有 scorer 组合，确认 exp_A 的 ρ≥0.90 finding 在完整矩阵上 hold（略低因为 include 了更多 distant pairs）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: K* cross-scorer matrix (generator × scorer)'\n    columns:\n    - generator_scorer\n    - Qwen-1.5B\n    - Pythia-1.4B\n    - OLMo-1B\n    - Qwen-7B\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen-1.5B-cont\n      - K*=2 (0.611)\n      - K*=1 (0.589)\n      - K*=1 (0.584)\n      - K*=2 (0.608)\n    - - Pythia-1.4B\n      - K*=2 (0.641)\n      - K*=2 (0.654)\n      - K*=2 (0.636)\n      - K*=2 (0.639)\n    - - OLMo-1B\n      - K*=2 (0.606)\n      - K*=2 (0.613)\n      - K*=2 (0.615)\n      - K*=2 (0.609)\n    - - Qwen-7B\n      - K*=2 (0.618)\n      - K*=1 (0.593)\n      - K*=1 (0.589)\n      - K*=2 (0.625)\n  - title: 'Table: Cross-scorer feature ranking consistency'\n    columns:\n    - scorer_pair\n    - spearman_rho\n    - p_value\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen-1.5B vs Pythia\n      - 0.921\n      - <0.001\n    - - Qwen-1.5B vs OLMo\n      - 0.908\n      - <0.001\n    - - Qwen-1.5B vs Qwen-7B\n      - 0.958\n      - <0.001\n    - - Pythia vs OLMo\n      - 0.947\n      - <0.001\n    - - Pythia vs Qwen-7B\n      - 0.896\n      - <0.001\n    - - OLMo vs Qwen-7B\n      - 0.873\n      - <0.001\n  figures_description:\n  - 'K* heatmap (4×4): color-coded by K* value, with 1v2 AUC annotated in each cell.\n    Clear pattern: diagonal and Pythia/OLMo rows green, Qwen rows mixed'\n  - '1v2 AUC heatmap: showing the systematic ~2pp cross-scorer penalty and generator-specific\n    baseline differences'\n  - 'Feature ranking Spearman ρ network graph: nodes=scorers, edge thickness=ρ, all\n    edges ≥0.87'\n  analysis: '12/16 K*=2 足以支撑 scorer independence claim（with scope）。论文措辞：\"K*=2 is scorer-\n    independent for generators with self-scored 1v2 AUC ≥ 0.63 (Pythia, OLMo); for\n    marginal generators (Qwen-cont, Qwen-7B with self-scored 1v2 AUC ≈ 0.61-0.62),\n    cross-scorer noise can push measurements below θ\"。这与 exp_A 的 K*=1 finding（Qwen-cont\n    cross-scored）完全一致。实际意义：实践者可以用任意 scorer 模型，只要 target generator 的 depth signal 不在阈值边缘。Feature\n    ranking ρ≥0.87 强化了 \"scorer 影响的是 magnitude 而非 feature structure\" 的论点。与 exp-013（cross-model\n    transfer）对照：exp-013 的 cross-model transfer retention 80-92% 测量的是 classifier 的\n    generalization，exp-022 测量的是 feature computation 的 scorer-dependence——两者从不同角度确认\n    depth signal 主要是 text-intrinsic。\n\n    '\n- name: Retrain-chain ecological validity\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: 'Pythia-1.4B LoRA retrain-chain (rank=16, alpha=32), depth 0-4, 与 prompt-chain\n    对比验证 ecological validity。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 2\n    pairwise_auc:\n      0v1: 0.9847\n      1v2: 0.6312\n      2v3: 0.5583\n      3v4: 0.5224\n    pairwise_auc_std:\n      0v1: 0.0019\n      1v2: 0.0085\n      2v3: 0.0072\n      3v4: 0.0098\n    bootstrap_ci:\n      0v1:\n        auc: 0.9847\n        ci_lower: 0.9822\n        ci_upper: 0.9872\n        perm_p: 0.0001\n      1v2:\n        auc: 0.6312\n        ci_lower: 0.6187\n        ci_upper: 0.6437\n        perm_p: 0.0001\n      2v3:\n        auc: 0.5583\n        ci_lower: 0.5472\n        ci_upper: 0.5694\n        perm_p: 0.0001\n      3v4:\n        auc: 0.5224\n        ci_lower: 0.5108\n        ci_upper: 0.534\n        perm_p: 0.0018\n    prompt_vs_retrain_comparison:\n      prompt_chain_1v2: 0.6539\n      retrain_chain_1v2: 0.6312\n      delta: -0.0227\n      feature_spearman_rho: 0.841\n      shared_top3: true\n    ordinal_mae: 1.152\n    ordinal_accuracy: 0.372\n  result_rationale: 'Retrain-chain K*=2 确认了 prompt-chain 的 ecological validity，但 1v2\n    AUC 低 2.3pp （0.631 vs 0.654）。差异的机制：LoRA rank=16 仅修改模型参数空间的一个低秩子空间， 每代 fine-tuning\n    的 distribution shift 比 prompt-chain 更 gradual（prompt-chain 中 每代的 output distribution\n    是 model(model(...)) 的嵌套，信息损失是 multiplicative； retrain-chain 的损失是 parameter-space\n    的 additive drift，被 LoRA 的低秩约束抑制）。 Feature ranking Spearman ρ=0.84（vs prompt-chain），top-3\n    features 共享（surp_d1_std, surp_std, surp_d2_std），说明两种 chain 的 degradation mechanism\n    虽然不同但在 feature space 上高度一致。0v1 AUC=0.985 略低于 prompt-chain 的 0.993——retrain-chain\n    的 gen1 更接近 human text（因为模型是在 human text 上 fine-tune 后再 generate，而非直接 prompt model\n    to continue）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Prompt-chain vs retrain-chain comparison (Pythia-1.4B)'\n    columns:\n    - chain_type\n    - 0v1\n    - 1v2\n    - 2v3\n    - 3v4\n    - k_star\n    - feature_ρ\n    rows:\n    - - prompt-chain\n      - 0.9932\n      - 0.6539\n      - 0.5515\n      - 0.5153\n      - 2\n      - '-'\n    - - retrain-chain\n      - 0.9847\n      - 0.6312\n      - 0.5583\n      - 0.5224\n      - 2\n      - 0.841\n  figures_description:\n  - 'AUC decay curves: prompt-chain vs retrain-chain overlay, showing parallel but\n    offset decay profiles'\n  - 'Feature importance comparison: side-by-side bar charts highlighting shared top\n    discriminators'\n  analysis: 'Ecological validity confirmed: K*=2 和 top features 在两种 chain type 间一致。1v2\n    的 -2.3pp gap 可解释为 LoRA 的 information-preserving bias（低秩约束 = 正则化 = 更慢 的 degradation）。论文定位：supporting\n    experiment，在 §4.1 的 footnote 或 Appendix 中报告。为 reviewer concern #3（\"prompt-chain\n    不代表真实污染\"）提供直接回应。 注意 depth 仅到 4（非 5），因为 retrain-chain 的 GPU cost 更高（每代需要 fine-tune）。\n\n    '\n- name: Contamination dose-response\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: '在 10%/30%/50% synthetic injection 比例下，比较 binary vs graduated filtering\n    的 downstream benefit scaling。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    dose_10pct:\n      binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5879\n      graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5876\n      no_filter_mmlu: 0.5873\n      binary_vs_nofilter_delta: +0.06pp\n      binary_vs_graduated_p: 0.42\n    dose_30pct:\n      binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5912\n      graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5897\n      no_filter_mmlu: 0.5858\n      binary_vs_nofilter_delta: +0.54pp\n      binary_vs_graduated_p: 0.08\n    dose_50pct:\n      binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5941\n      graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5892\n      no_filter_mmlu: 0.5865\n      binary_vs_nofilter_delta: +0.76pp\n      binary_vs_graduated_p: 0.003\n    dose_response_slope:\n      binary_benefit_per_10pct: +0.016pp MMLU\n      graduated_gap_widens: true\n    key_finding: binary advantage scales with contamination dose; graduated never\n      outperforms binary at any dose level\n  result_rationale: 'Dose-response 结果直接从 K*=2 的 information-theoretic implication\n    推导：因为 K*=2， depth ≥2 的文本与 depth 1 的文本在 feature space 中几乎不可区分，所以 graduated weighting\n    （试图利用 fine-grained depth signal beyond K*）无法比 binary filtering（只区分 depth 0 vs\n    depth ≥1）做得更好。在低 contamination dose（10%）时，filtering 的 absolute benefit 极小（~0.06pp\n    MMLU），因为 contaminated fraction 本身很小——这使得所有策略的 difference 在统计噪声中不可分辨（p=0.42）。随着\n    dose 增加到 30% 和 50%，binary filtering 的优势 开始统计显著（50% dose: p=0.003），因为有更多 contaminated\n    samples 可被正确过滤。 Graduated 在 50% dose 时的 MMLU（0.5892）与 exp-006 完全一致（实验复现）。 Binary-vs-graduated\n    gap 从 10%（+0.03pp, n.s.）扩大到 50%（+0.49pp, p=0.003）， 说明 graduated 的 over-fitting\n    to noise beyond K* 在高 contamination 下更有害。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Dose-response MMLU comparison'\n    columns:\n    - dose\n    - binary_ours\n    - graduated_a09\n    - no_filter\n    - binary vs no-filter Δ\n    - binary vs grad p\n    rows:\n    - - 10%\n      - 0.5879\n      - 0.5876\n      - 0.5873\n      - +0.06pp\n      - 0.42 (n.s.)\n    - - 30%\n      - 0.5912\n      - 0.5897\n      - 0.5858\n      - +0.54pp\n      - 0.08 (marginal)\n    - - 50%\n      - 0.5941\n      - 0.5892\n      - 0.5865\n      - +0.76pp\n      - 0.003 **\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Dose vs MMLU line plot: three strategies (binary, graduated, no-filter) showing\n    divergence with increasing dose'\n  - 'Binary-vs-graduated delta vs dose: monotonically increasing gap, annotated with\n    p-values'\n  analysis: 'Dose-response 是 C3 claim 的重要补充。Key message: K*-aware binary filtering\n    的优势 不是 dose-specific artifact——它在所有测试 dose 下都是最优策略（虽然在低 dose 下差异 不显著）。Graduated\n    filtering 的 failure 同样 dose-invariant，验证了 K*=2 作为 universal curation guideline\n    的 actionability。Limitation: 仅测了 3 个 dose 点， 连续 dose-response curve 留作 future work。论文定位：exp-006\n    (50% dose) 的 补充 ablation，放在 Appendix 或 §4.3 的 subsection。\n\n    '\n- name: Naturalistic Common Crawl validation\n  plan_id: exp-014\n  description: '对 Common Crawl 2025/2026 snapshot 样本做 depth prediction，与 AlignScore\n    和 vocabulary richness 指标做 correlation analysis。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_documents: 50000\n    predicted_depth_distribution:\n      cc_2025:\n        depth_0: 0.72\n        depth_1: 0.18\n        depth_2: 0.07\n        depth_3+: 0.03\n      cc_2026:\n        depth_0: 0.65\n        depth_1: 0.22\n        depth_2: 0.09\n        depth_3+: 0.04\n    correlation_with_alignscore:\n      spearman_rho: 0.418\n      p_value: <0.001\n      interpretation: 'moderate positive: higher predicted depth ↔ lower text quality'\n    correlation_with_vocab_richness:\n      ttr_spearman: -0.372\n      hapax_spearman: -0.341\n      freq_entropy_spearman: -0.389\n    temporal_shift:\n      mean_predicted_depth_2025: 0.42\n      mean_predicted_depth_2026: 0.51\n      shift_p_value: <0.001\n  result_rationale: 'Naturalistic validation 是 median 档最不确定的实验。AlignScore correlation\n    ρ=0.42 是 moderate 而非 strong，原因：(1) Common Crawl 包含大量非递归合成文本（SEO spam, template\n    text, translation artifacts）会被误判为有 depth 信号；(2) AlignScore 主要衡量 factual consistency\n    而非 distributional degradation，两者 correlated 但不 identical；(3) 没有 ground truth depth\n    labels，所有分析都是 correlational。Vocabulary richness 指标与 predicted depth 的负相关（ρ=-0.34\n    到 -0.39）符合 degradation ordering 预期：更深代次 的文本 vocabulary diversity 更低。2025→2026\n    的 predicted depth 增加（mean 0.42→0.51） 与公开报告的合成文本增长趋势一致，但 confounded by CC 爬取策略变化。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Predicted depth distribution in Common Crawl snapshots'\n    columns:\n    - snapshot\n    - depth 0\n    - depth 1\n    - depth 2\n    - depth 3+\n    - mean_depth\n    rows:\n    - - CC 2025-Q1\n      - 72%\n      - 18%\n      - 7%\n      - 3%\n      - 0.42\n    - - CC 2026-Q1\n      - 65%\n      - 22%\n      - 9%\n      - 4%\n      - 0.51\n  - title: 'Table: Correlation with text quality indicators'\n    columns:\n    - indicator\n    - spearman_ρ\n    - p_value\n    - direction\n    rows:\n    - - AlignScore\n      - 0.418\n      - <0.001\n      - higher depth → lower quality\n    - - TTR\n      - -0.372\n      - <0.001\n      - higher depth → lower diversity\n    - - Hapax ratio\n      - -0.341\n      - <0.001\n      - higher depth → fewer rare words\n    - - Freq entropy\n      - -0.389\n      - <0.001\n      - higher depth → lower entropy\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Predicted depth histogram: 2025 vs 2026 side-by-side showing rightward shift'\n  - 'Scatter plots: predicted depth vs AlignScore / TTR / freq_entropy with regression\n    lines'\n  analysis: 'Naturalistic validation 提供 suggestive 而非 conclusive evidence。论文措辞谨慎：\n    \"Predicted depth distributions are consistent with reported trends in synthetic\n    content prevalence\" + \"moderate correlation with independent quality measures\n    provides convergent validity for the OBD framework\"。明确 limitation：no ground truth,\n    correlational only, confounded by non-recursive synthetic text。 论文定位：§5 Discussion\n    的一个 subsection 或 Appendix。\n\n    '\n- name: Wikipedia domain ablation\n  plan_id: exp-023\n  description: 'Wikipedia seed data, Qwen2.5-1.5B base continuation, 验证 K*=2 是否跨数据域一致。\n    Status: orphaned（可能因优先级调整被搁置）。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    k_star: 2\n    pairwise_auc:\n      0v1: 0.9912\n      1v2: 0.6183\n      2v3: 0.5518\n      3v4: 0.5247\n      4v5: 0.5112\n    bootstrap_ci:\n      0v1:\n        auc: 0.9912\n        ci_lower: 0.9895\n        ci_upper: 0.9929\n        perm_p: 0.0001\n      1v2:\n        auc: 0.6183\n        ci_lower: 0.6074\n        ci_upper: 0.6292\n        perm_p: 0.0001\n      2v3:\n        auc: 0.5518\n        ci_lower: 0.5415\n        ci_upper: 0.5621\n        perm_p: 0.0001\n      3v4:\n        auc: 0.5247\n        ci_lower: 0.5142\n        ci_upper: 0.5352\n        perm_p: 0.0003\n      4v5:\n        auc: 0.5112\n        ci_lower: 0.5007\n        ci_upper: 0.5217\n        perm_p: 0.0312\n    c4_vs_wiki_comparison:\n      c4_1v2: 0.6262\n      wiki_1v2: 0.6183\n      delta: -0.0079\n      feature_ranking_rho: 0.878\n    ordinal_mae: 1.178\n    ordinal_accuracy: 0.369\n    top_features:\n    - surp_std\n    - freq_entropy\n    - surp_d1_std\n    - surp_d1_skew\n    - surp_mean\n  result_rationale: 'Wikipedia K*=2 与 C4 一致但 1v2 AUC 低 0.8pp（0.618 vs 0.626）。差异的来源：\n    Wikipedia 文本有更强的 structural formatting（section headers, lists, citations,  infobox-derived\n    text），这些 domain-specific patterns 在 continuation mode 下被 model 部分保留，减少了 generation-specific\n    degradation signal。freq_entropy 在 Wikipedia 上的 discriminative power 略低，因为 Wikipedia\n    的 vocabulary distribution 本身更集中 （专业术语 + 百科体裁的 formulaic expressions）。Feature ranking\n    ρ=0.878 vs C4 说明 degradation mechanism 跨域一致但 feature importance 的具体排列有 domain-specific\n    shift。 整体结论：K*=2 是 domain-independent，支持 universality claim 的 scope 扩展。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: C4 vs Wikipedia domain comparison (Qwen-base)'\n    columns:\n    - domain\n    - 0v1\n    - 1v2\n    - 1v2 CI lower\n    - 2v3\n    - k_star\n    rows:\n    - - C4\n      - 0.987\n      - 0.6262\n      - 0.6168\n      - 0.5496\n      - 2\n    - - Wikipedia\n      - 0.9912\n      - 0.6183\n      - 0.6074\n      - 0.5518\n      - 2\n  figures_description:\n  - 'AUC decay curves: C4 vs Wikipedia overlay showing near-identical profiles'\n  - 'Feature importance comparison: highlighting freq_entropy''s domain-specific rank\n    shift'\n  analysis: 'Domain ablation 是 universality claim 的 low-hanging fruit supplement。K*=2\n    holds， feature ranking 高度一致（ρ=0.878），domain 对 K* 没有影响。但 orphaned status 意味着 这个实验可能不会在\n    EMNLP submission 前完成——如果时间不够，可以将其定位为 \"future work: systematic domain ablation\n    across web, academic, and code domains\"。如果完成， 放入 Appendix 作为 universality 的额外\n    data point。\n\n    '\n","numLines":1197,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1197}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01LEZCeHmdniMsAJudQvumdU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've now read the full paper (9 pages) and the review context YAML. Let me summarize what I have:\n\n**Paper**: \"The Discrimination Boundary of Recursive Text Generation: Measuring K* Across Architectures, Decoding Strategies, and Domains\"\n\n**Key claims**:\n1. C1: K*=2 is a robust discrimination boundary under standard conditions (≥256 tokens, T≥0.9, compatible scorer architecture)\n2. C2: First systematic measurement of K* across 6 model families, 4 decoding strategies, 2 domains, 3 text lengths (19 conditions total; 14/14 standard conditions yield K*=2)\n\n\n3. C3: Three principled boundary conditions where K* degrades to 1, each predicted by DPI\n4. C4: K*=2 provides actionable curation guidance — binary filtering outperforms graduated\n\n**Experiments in paper**:\n- §4.1: Cross-architecture universality (6 models) — Table 1\n- §4.2: 4×4 cross-scorer matrix — Table 2\n- §4.3: Decoding strategy invariance (Pythia) — Table 3\n- §4.4: Text length ablation — Tables 4, 5\n- §4.5: Domain ablation (Wikipedia) — Table 6\n- §4.6: Ecological validity (retrain-chain)\n- §4.7: K*-aware data curation (dose-response) — Table 8\n- §4.8: Naturalistic validation on Common Crawl — Table 9\n- §5: Analysis and Discussion (boundary conditions, implications)\n- Table 10: Summary of all 19 conditions\n\nThe remaining experiments I'm planning to run include depth chains across different model families like LLaMA and Mistral, additional ablations on decoding strategies and text length, the cross-scorer matrix, ecological validity checks, contamination dose-response curves, and validation on naturalistic Common Crawl data alongside Wikipedia domain tests.\n\nNow I need to set up two parallel reviewers—one focused on methods and experiments, another on novelty and related work—then run them through a structured roundt