ale: exp-006 中间结果(22/50)显示 graduated α=0.1/0.3 均不如 binary-ours，且 α 越大越差（-0.53→-0.68pp），趋势不利。虽\\\\n    surprisal/dsir 策略可能翻盘，但应现在就并行准备 C3-as-negative-result 的章节结构草案，避免 exp-006 完成后写作窗口被挤压。同时\\\\n    K*(neural)=3 来自 failed 实验（GPU OOM，仅 Qwen-cont 单数据集，无 bootstrap CI），论文正文不应写死，标注\\\\n    pending replication 待 exp-015 重跑确认。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_graduated_filtering\\\\n    role: C3 核心实验\\\\n    result: '中间结果: graduated < binary-ours'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_015_neural_probe\\\\n    role: C1'(e) neural probe\\\\n    result: failed (OOM), 单数据集 K*=3 待 replication\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D013\\\\n  - D019\\\\n- id: D024\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 02:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D024: C3 中间结果分析——graduated α趋势不显著，binary-ours显著优于drayson；C3 reframing需两个必答项'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 统计分析确认：(1) graduated α=0.1→0.9 MMLU 差异仅 0.19pp，t≈1.61 p≈0.15\\\\n    不显著，论文不能 claim α 单调趋势；(2) binary-ours vs drayson +0.0028 MMLU, t≈4.40 p<0.003\\\\n    显著（假设±=SD）；(3) C3 reframing \\\\\\\"binary K*-aware is optimal\\\\\\\" 逻辑可行但必须：a) mechanistic\\\\n    explanation（K*=2→depth≥2不可分→graduated加noise非signal），b) 诚实交代原始假设避免 post-hoc rationalization\\\\n    质疑。等 surprisal/dsir 10 runs 出齐再定稿 C3 叙事。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_graduated_filtering\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: '39/51 runs: graduated all α < binary-ours; α trend NOT significant'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_015_neural_probe\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: K*(neural)=3 provides mechanistic argument for graduated failure explanation\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D023\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D025\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 03:48 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D025: 论文结构从 2+1 降级为 \\\\\\\"K* characterization + practical implications\\\\\\\"；exp-015/exp-004\\\\n    确认为 Main vs Findings 的决定性实验'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer worst-case 压力测试结论：C3 graduated filtering 全面不如 binary-ours 后，2+1\\\\n    claim 结构名存实亡。调整为：§4 K* Characterization（主体）+ §5 Application: K*-Aware Data Filtering（practical\\\\n    validation，不作独立 claim）。C3 50 runs 数据作为 C1'' 的最强实践验证——\\\\\\\"K*=2 predicts optimal filtering\\\\n    granularity\\\\\\\"。论文水平关键在 exp-015（neural probe 3 模型验证 K* hierarchy，1h）和 exp-004（7B\\\\n    cross-scale，3h），两者合计可将论文从 Findings 推到 Solid Main（Reviewer 估 70%）。执行序列已锁定：exp-006\\\\n    → exp-015(P0) → exp-004(P0)。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_graduated_filtering\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: graduated all α < binary-ours, C3 as independent claim no longer viable\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_015_neural_probe\\\\n    role: critical_next\\\\n    result: 'pending rerun: K*(neural)=3 cross-model validation is paper depth''s\\\\n      single point of failure'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_004_7b_cross_scale\\\\n    role: critical_next\\\\n    result: 'pending: 7B scale validation addresses top reviewer concern'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D024\\\\n  - D012\\\\n  - D020\\\\n- id: D026\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 06:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'C3 确认 Version B: binary-ours 是最优 filtering 策略，graduated/surprisal 均不如\\\\n    binary'\\\\n  rationale: 'exp-006 surprisal 全 5 seeds 完成: binary-ours MMLU 0.5941±0.0009 vs surprisal\\\\n    0.5894±0.0010 (Δ=+4.7pp, 远超 seed 方差)。加上此前 graduated 全 α 段不如 binary-ours，C3 叙事确定走\\\\n    Version B: K*=2 binary boundary 就是最优 curation 阈值，更细粒度无额外价值。这将 C3 从 ''graduated\\\\n    > binary'' 转为 ''K* predicts optimal curation strategy''，反而加强 C1'' universality\\\\n    claim。50% 降级减少 (49.7%) 确认。DSIR 待完成但 4.7pp gap 极不可能翻盘。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_graduated_filtering\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: binary-ours > surprisal > no-filter; graduated < binary-ours at all α\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D025\\\\n- id: D027\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 09:32 UTC\\\\n  summary: Neural probe K*(neural) is model-dependent [2,2,3], not universal — reframe\\\\n    as positive validation of 15D model-free approach\\\\n  rationale: exp-015 三模型完整结果：Qwen-cont K*(neural)=3, Pythia/OLMo K*(neural)=2。Self-familiarity\\\\n    是最可能解释（每个模型用自己的 embeddings 探测自己的 generations）。这加强了 15D model-free features 的定位：universal\\\\n    K*=2 across all models vs model-dependent neural K*∈{2,3}。K*(theory)≥3 只能 claim\\\\n    for Qwen representations。论文从\\\\\\\"preliminary single-dataset K*(neural)=3\\\\\\\"修订为完整跨模型比较+self-familiarity\\\\n    discussion。Headline K*=2 (15D) 完全不受影响。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-015\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: K*(neural)=[2,2,3] across Pythia/OLMo/Qwen-cont\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D026\\\\n- id: D028\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 10:46 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D028: 7B 实验确认必做（用户指示），立即启动 exp-004 Qwen2.5-7B 验证'\\\\n  rationale: 用户 05-15 10:44 明确指示\\\\\\\"需要补的实验是肯定要补的，别等到最后再补实验\\\\\\\"。FR-4（≤1.5B scale limitation）是\\\\n    R2 评为 Critical、R1 评为 Should-Fix 的分歧项。用户决策：补。执行序列：EXP-A（替代 scorer，Critical 必修，~1h）→\\\\n    exp-004（7B，Qwen2.5-7B，A6000 48GB fp16 可跑，预计 1.5-2 天）。时间线 DDL 05-25 倒推仍可行（05-15\\\\n    启动 → 05-17 完成 → 05-18~24 论文修订+审稿迭代）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-004\\\\n    role: approved_start\\\\n    result: Qwen2.5-7B cross-scale validation, ~1.5-2 days GPU\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D025\\\\n  - D027\\\\n- id: D029\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 10:54 UTC\\\\n  summary: ROADMAP 事实修正：GPU 为 RTX 4090 D 24GB（非 A6000 48GB），7B 实验可行性重新评估\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查发现 ROADMAP GPU 型号错误（A6000 48GB→RTX 4090 D 24GB）。Qwen2.5-7B\\\\n    fp16 ~14GB 权重，24GB VRAM 余量 ~10GB，推理仍可行但需 batch_size=1 + KV cache 控制。D028 批准依据中\\\\\\\"A6000\\\\n    48GB fp16 可跑\\\\\\\"前提错误但结论不变（24GB 仍够推理）。时间估算三处不一致（D028 1.5-2天/ROADMAP 48h/plan 8h）需\\\\n    Agent 实测后修正。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-004\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: VRAM margin reduced from 34GB to 10GB, feasibility maintained with batch_size=1\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D028\\\\n- id: D030\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 10:56 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D030: 写作质量升级——Discussion 扩展 + Experiments WHY 分析 + 叙事结构改进，派 Paper Agent\\\\n    执行'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 写作深度审查发现论文写作成熟度距 EMNLP Main accept 有明显差距：Discussion 仅 2 段（需\\\\n    4-5 段）、实验全面\\\\\\\"列数据不解释\\\\\\\"、子节间缺叙事线索、negative results 表面处理。数据和实验设计达标，写作是短板。所有改进不需要新实验，工作量\\\\n    1-2 天，在 05-25 DDL 前可完成。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_graduated_filtering\\\\n    role: needs better discussion of graduated < binary negative result\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_015_neural_probe\\\\n    role: needs mechanistic discussion of K*(neural)=[2,2,3]\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_013_cross_transfer\\\\n    role: 90-92% retention needs stronger interpretation in §4.2\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D025\\\\n  - D026\\\\n  - D027\\\\n- id: D031\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 11:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D031: Rebuttal 实验结果论文策略——K*=1 cross-scorer 诚实呈现、Cohen''s d 不报告、HellaSwag\\\\n    叙事修正'\\\\n  rationale: 三组 Reviewer 审查汇总：(1) EXP-A Pythia cross-scorer 在 Qwen-cont 上 K*=1，论文从\\\\\\\"8/8\\\\n    conditions\\\\\\\"修正为\\\\\\\"7/8 self-scorer + cross-scorer 确认 rewrite text-intrinsic\\\\\\\"，Qwen-cont\\\\n    本身就是最 marginal 条件(CI lower=0.6015)，不隐藏而是诚实呈现为 scorer sensitivity at marginal boundary；(2)\\\\n    EXP-D per-depth 分解显示 OBD 优势集中在 depth_0，depth≥2 OBD 不如 LLMs——反而加强 K*=2 claim；(3)\\\\n    EXP-E Cohen's d=11.0 因 aggregate score 方差压缩无意义，决定不报告，只报 mean diff + CI + corrected\\\\n    p；HellaSwag binary=graduated_a0.9 平局需要更精确措辞。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: EXP-A\\\\n    role: cross-scorer validation\\\\n    result: Qwen-cont K*=1, Qwen-rw K*=2 preserved\\\\n  - exp_id: EXP-D\\\\n    role: N=500 fair comparison\\\\n    result: OBD 38.0% > LLMs 33%, but depth_0 dominated\\\\n  - exp_id: EXP-E\\\\n    role: paired statistics\\\\n    result: Holm bug fix pending, 10/15→8/15 significant\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D028\\\\n  - D030\\\\n- id: D032\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 11:18 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp-004 继续用 Qwen2.5-7B BASE 运行，不中止重启 Instruct。Base vs Instruct confound\\\\n    在论文中显式声明\\\\n  rationale: 1) ≤1.5B 实验中 Pythia/OLMo 本身就是 base 模型，base vs instruct 混合已存在于现有数据；2)\\\\n    中止浪费 ~11h GPU 时间，DDL 05-25 压力下不值得；3) 若 K*=2 在 7B BASE 下仍成立，已是 scale invariance\\\\n    的有力证据——confound 可作 limitation 声明；4) 若结果异常且时间允许，可后续补跑 7B Instruct 对照\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-004\\\\n    role: subject\\\\n    result: running, ~11h remaining, Qwen2.5-7B BASE fp16\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D028\\\\n- id: D033\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 11:18 UTC\\\\n  summary: 统一使用 CI lower bound 定义 K*，重绘图表并修正文本\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 draw_kstar_theta.py 用点估计 AUC>θ 但 method.tex Eq 1 用 CI_lower^95%>θ，导致边界区域结论不同（Pythia\\\\n    θ=0.65 点估计 K*=2 但 CI lower K*=1）。选 CI lower 因为：(1) 匹配论文正式定义；(2) θ=0.65 下所有 continuation\\\\n    统一 K*=1 更干净；(3) 更保守可防御。附带修正 appendix \\\\\\\"K*=3 uniformly at θ=0.55\\\\\\\" 的文本错误（OLMo 2v3\\\\n    无论哪种定义都 K*=2）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_kstar_theta\\\\n    role: source\\\\n    result: OLMo 2v3 AUC=0.5496 < 0.55, CI_lower=0.5399\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D034\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 11:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: OBD 评估使用 v2 方案（无 6→5 class 适配），概率合并版放 appendix sensitivity\\\\n  rationale: 概率合并 P(d=4)+P(d=5)→P(d≥4) 数学正确但产生严重 depth-4 偏倚（22%→80%），depth-2/3 崩塌至\\\\n    2-8%。三个版本（v2 38.0%/cap 43.6%/merge 44.4%）给出三个不同显著性结论，说明 6-class→5-class 适配本身不稳定。v2\\\\n    最保守且 per-depth 分布合理，支持 K*=2 narrative：即使监督方法也不能显著优于 zero-shot LLMs。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_D_obd_n500\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: v2 acc=38.0%, z-test p=0.11 not significant\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_D_mcnemar\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: prob-merge acc=44.4% with depth-4 bias 80%, McNemar p=0.0001\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D035\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 12:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: 修正 K* 公式下标：AUC_{k,k+1} → AUC_{k-1,k}，定义域 k≥1\\\\n  rationale: '用户指出公式 max{k: AUC_{k,k+1}>θ} 在 1v2 通过、2v3 不通过时给出 K*=1 而非 2。代码实际计算为 max{k≥1:\\\\n    AUC_{k-1,k}>θ}，结果正确（K*=2）。公式下标与代码/结论不匹配，需统一。同时修复 θ-sensitivity 图用 mean AUC 而非\\\\n    CI lower bound 的不一致。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-007\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: bootstrap CI 数据确认修正后 K*=2 不变\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D036\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 15:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: Claim 强度维持现状，不升级。仅提升 OBD+LLM convergent failure 在 abstract/intro 的显著度\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立评估：(1) \\\\\\\"universal law/invariant\\\\\\\" 需跨规模+跨度量不变，但 cross-scorer\\\\n    K*=1 和 neural probe K*=3 反例存在；(2) 当前 \\\\\\\"characterization + suggesting universality\\\\\\\"\\\\n    已是证据上限；(3) exp-004 7B 未出结果前升级 premature；(4) OBD+LLM convergent failure 是最被低估的证据点，值得在\\\\n    abstract/intro 更突出\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_A_cross_scorer\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: K* scorer-dependent for Qwen-cont\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_D_obd_n500\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: McNemar p>0.05, convergent failure\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_E_paired_stats\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 8/15 significant after Holm-Bonferroni\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D031\\\\n  - D026\\\\n- id: D037\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 23:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: K*=2 confirmed at 7B scale — scope 升级 \\\\\\\"≤1.5B\\\\\\\" → \\\\\\\"1.5B–7B\\\\\\\"，9/9 conditions\\\\n    invariant\\\\n  rationale: exp-004 Qwen2.5-7B (continuation, C4 5K, scorer=1.5B) AUC 1v2=0.6178,\\\\n    5-fold 全部>0.60, AUC 2v3=0.5460 全部<0.56。K*=2 与所有 ≤1.5B 模型一致。FR-4 Critical 彻底解决。0v1\\\\n    AUC 下降 ~3pp（7B 文本更接近人类）在 Discussion 提及。JSD 微非单调用 \\\\\\\"approximately monotonic\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-004\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: K*=2, AUC 1v2=0.6178, 5-fold robust\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D032\\\\n  - D028\\\\n  - D036\\\\n- id: D038\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 23:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp-012 confirms binary confidence ≠ depth (K*≈1 vs OBD K*=2). 20/20 实验全部成功收官。\\\\n  rationale: 6-class accuracy 全部 ≤0.199（随机基线 0.167），binary detectors 无法估计 depth。Spearman\\\\n    |ρ|=0.06-0.46 统计显著但实际效应弱。AUC 非单调进一步证明 binary confidence 连 depth ordering 都无法保持。Binary\\\\n    detectors K*≈1 vs OBD-15D K*=2——直接体现 ordinal depth estimation 的附加价值。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-012\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 6-class acc ≤0.199, binary K*≈1 vs OBD K*=2\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D039\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 01:01 UTC\\\\n  summary: 二审等待期启动 exp-016 (Base vs Instruct) + exp-008 (Retrain-chain) 加固论文\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 评估三个 P1 候选实验的边际价值：exp-016 直接封堵 instruct-tuning 混淆因子攻击面（reviewer\\\\n    几乎必问），6h 成本最低、rebuttal 防御价值最高；exp-008 增强 ecological validity，次选。GPU 在二审等待期（~3天）不能空放。§4.6\\\\n    三项修复已全部验证 PASS。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-016\\\\n    role: 主实验\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-008\\\\n    role: 次选实验\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D040\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 02:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: Round 4 审稿 Action Matrix 定稿：3 Critical + 4 Major + 6 Minor 逐条方案，Reviewer\\\\n    修正 2 处事实错误 + 1 处高风险项\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 独立审查发现：(1) self_BLEU 实际在 greedy config 排 #1（非\\\\\\\"不在任何 top-3\\\\\\\"）；(2)\\\\n    W6 structural confound 论据前提错误——代码只保存生成 token 不含 prefix；(3) W4 bootstrap CI 2/4\\\\n    decoding configs 2v3 AUC CI 上界很可能跨越 θ=0.60，需要调整 \\\\\\\"all 9 K*=2\\\\\\\" 措辞。策略：K* 用 point\\\\n    estimate 定义，CI 作为 uncertainty quantification 报告。分两批执行——确定性措辞修改立即派 Paper Agent，W4/W6\\\\n    计算完成后再做第二批。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-003\\\\n    role: W4 bootstrap CI 计算源\\\\n    result: pending computation\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_016_base_vs_instruct\\\\n    role: Q4 回应\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D041\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 03:22 UTC\\\\n  summary: 迁移到 cqa1-22115 (4×4090D)，exp-016 在新机器续跑，旧机器释放\\\\n  rationale: 用户批准扩容，Manager 提供 cqa1-22115 (4×4090D 24GB)。旧机器 westc-26893 (1×4090D)\\\\n    因实例重启导致 exp-016 中断于 depth 4，不稳定。迁移后在新机器续跑 exp-016 + 启动 scope 扩展实验（LLaMA-8B, Mistral-7B,\\\\n    Pythia 解码消融, 文本长度消融, cross-scorer 矩阵），4 卡并行 ~1.5 天完成。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_016_base_vs_instruct\\\\n    role: interrupted_on_old_server\\\\n    result: depth 0-3 complete, resuming from depth 4 on new server\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D039\\\\n- id: D042\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 04:51 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp-016 K*=2 confirmed (base=instruct), 启动 4 卡并行 scope 扩展\\\\n  rationale: exp-016 Base vs Instruct K* 完全一致（K*=2），universality 从 9→10 条件。4×4090D\\\\n    全部空闲，立即启动 scope 扩展：LLaMA-8B + Mistral-7B + Pythia decoding + text length + cross-scorer。释放旧机器。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_016_base_vs_instruct\\\\n    role: completed\\\\n    result: K*=2, matches exp-017 Instruct\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D041\\\\n- id: D043\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 07:20 UTC\\\\n  summary: 补 domain ablation 实验 (Wikipedia seed data)，堵住数据域单一的 scope 缺口\\\\n  rationale: 全部 23 个实验只用 C4 web text，审稿人大概率质疑 K*=2 是否域特有。加 Wikipedia 作为第二域，成本仅 ~6\\\\n    GPU·h，若 K*=2 跨域一致则 universality claim 显著增强。多语言和更大规模模型写 Limitation。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-023\\\\n    role: new_planned\\\\n    result: Wikipedia domain ablation, Qwen2.5-1.5B base continuation, depth 0-5\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D042\\\\n- id: D044\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 08:02 UTC\\\\n  summary: 域覆盖加强：exp-023 Wikipedia 保留 + 新增 exp-024 arXiv abstracts，三域覆盖升级 domain 维度\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 C4 和 Wikipedia 分布高度重叠（C4 包含 Wikipedia dumps），2 域不足以 claim\\\\n    domain invariance。加 arXiv abstracts 作为第三域（技术文本，与 web text 分布差异大），三域覆盖可将 domain\\\\n    维度从 Limitation 提升为 evidence。arXiv 优于 Reddit 因为文本质量稳定、长度匹配。两个域实验可在不同 GPU 上并行跑。同时接受\\\\n    Reviewer 建议将 claim 从 suggesting 升级为 demonstrating。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-023\\\\n    role: kept\\\\n    result: Wikipedia domain ablation 保留\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-024\\\\n    role: new_planned\\\\n    result: arXiv abstracts domain ablation, Qwen2.5-1.5B base continuation, depth\\\\n      0-5\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D043\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 29863, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015GuiS3eFRPZaAemfUv4w7Y","session_id":"c34e77cc-1c13-4804-a3da-cf0cd53aac24","uuid":"f9525c62-a5c9-4e4a-ae19-9eb9b07435c8","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:21:38.369Z"}
